window.ISSUES_HANT = [{"id":"008","date":"2026-10-30","period":"2026.10.26 – 2026.11.01","title":"地方行動與跨國呼籲：女性權益的多線推進","summary":"本期關注女性權益的多線推進：韓國地方性別會議、摩洛哥和平決策倡導、澳大利亞競選性別爭議；印尼與印度職場開放；美國與墨西哥生育權利；也門圍困呼籲、監禁分娩束縛禁令；以及金子文子電影重映。","en":{"title":"Local Actions and Transnational Calls: Advancing Women's Rights","summary":"This week covers multiple fronts of women’s rights: local gender meetings in South Korea, peace decision-making in Morocco, Australian election gender disputes, workplace openings in Indonesia and India, reproductive rights in the US and Mexico, Yemen’s siege appeal, shackling ban in childbirth, and a film re-screening about Kaneko Fumiko."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"林陽子","name_en":"Yoko Hayashi","role":"律師 / 前聯合國消除對婦女歧視委員會主席","role_en":"Lawyer / former Chair of the UN Committee on the Elimination of Discrimination against Women","region":"東亞","why":"她長期參與國際婦女人權審查，曾任聯合國消除對婦女歧視委員會主席，現在在松戶市男女共同參畫中心活動上做基調解說，將國際標準帶入地方性別平等討論。","why_en":"She has long worked on international women's human rights review, serving as Chair of the UN CEDAW Committee. Now she brings international standards into local gender equality discussions through a keynote speech in Matsudo.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFA5Ti1UR2ZWR3IwdVk5TjdyQlZEVXlLZzdwSWVuR2NtU2RheHFnV0U2ZVRpemwxMGhxbnlVQkVxVWdUZy1POG4tUlVORVc2bXc?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"燃燒女子的肖像","book":"房思琪的初戀樂園","art":"潘玉良"},"sections":[{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"008-1","t":"仁川桂陽區召開女性親善性別平等會議","d":"韓國仁川桂陽區近日召開女性親善與性別平等會議，討論如何將性別平等政策落實到地區治理和市民日常生活中。","body":["仁川桂陽區近日召開以“女性親善”和“性別平等”為主題的會議，區政府與相關機構圍繞提升女性生活質量和促進性別平衡展開討論。會議議程包括地方政策評估與下一步計劃，意在讓性別視角進入社區公共服務和城市空間規劃。","韓國地方政府普遍設有性別平等相關委員會或協商機制，通過社區層面的政策推動女性就業、安全與參與。此類會議雖屬常規行政程序，但在地方選舉臨近時往往被賦予更多政策信號意義，成為檢驗執政者性別議程誠意的窗口。","地方層面的性別平等會議常被批評流於形式，但若能落實具體項目，也可能成為改善女性公共服務的起點。關鍵在於後續預算與執行是否跟進，以及市民能否有效監督，避免會議淪為拍照和新聞稿。"],"why":"韓國地方政府主動召開女性親善會議並不罕見，但此類活動常缺乏公眾關注，具體成果難以追蹤。","en":{"t":"Incheon Gyeyang-gu holds women-friendly gender equality meeting","d":"The district government of Gyeyang-gu, Incheon, convened a meeting on women-friendly and gender equality policies, aiming to bring gender balance into local governance and daily life.","body":["Gyeyang-gu, Incheon, recently held a meeting under the theme of women-friendly and gender equality. District officials and related organizations discussed local policies and next steps.","Such local meetings are common in South Korea, but their impact depends on implementation and budget follow-up. Critics often question whether they produce concrete change beyond administrative routine."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"CNB뉴스","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5zVFRfYjlwSU82VE9jNWdRV1JKNWpORGxQZWJvNnB2QkFxaG1tMGFvb0kwLTN3TkhJOVlJdUJZZ1pzcFUyU0phMUlhYXkxd2VTd1FyYWlZeWhienV3VHF2ZVJGSjVlUVdIMW5V?oc=5","region":"東亞"},{"id":"008-2","t":"摩洛哥研討呼籲擴大女性決策參與以促進可持續和平","d":"摩洛哥一場研討會呼籲提高女性在決策層的代表性，並將性別平等納入和平建設，以推動可持續和平。這是北非國家近期又一次關於女性與和平議程的公開討論。","body":["摩洛哥舉辦了一場專題研討會，與會者呼籲擴大女性在決策中的參與，並將性別平等納入和平與安全議程。會議強調了女性領導力對可持續和平的作用，並提出將女性視角引入安全部門與衝突調解機制。","聯合國安理會第1325號決議通過後，多個國家制定國家行動計劃，但在北非地區，女性在安全與決策領域仍面臨明顯代表性不足。摩洛哥近年來在家庭法等方面有所改革，但政治與安全領域女性佔比仍低，社會阻力依然存在。","這類研討會能否轉化為實際政策，取決於政府是否願意在安全部門和高層職位中吸納女性。對摩洛哥而言，增加女性參與既是外部壓力，也與國內改革訴求相互交織，可能成為推動更廣泛政治改革的切入點。"],"why":"在和平與安全議題上，女性通常被視為受害者而非決策者，這場研討試圖扭轉這一視角。","en":{"t":"Morocco seminar calls for more women in decision-making for sustainable peace","d":"A seminar in Morocco urged greater representation of women in decision-making and inclusion of gender equality in peacebuilding.","body":["Participants at a seminar in Morocco called for expanding women's participation in decision-making and integrating gender equality into peace and security policies.","Despite international frameworks like UN Resolution 1325, women remain underrepresented in security and political leadership in North Africa. Real change depends on government willingness to appoint women to senior roles."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"إيلاف","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1KWEoyNnBjZUdWODlTcHVlUTZNNmFqeml0SUNZNjJfenBfb19YbTNzaVJBeW1Hay1KU3FUUURGVFRYTE1uV2EwazZCam5sWDd6TWdzNnVrRUxFT29Qanc?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"008-3","t":"澳大利亞自由黨候選人談性別平等承諾時遭噓聲","d":"在澳大利亞一場競選活動中，自由黨候選人提出性別平等主張時被現場觀眾喝倒彩，顯示公眾對政黨性別政策缺乏信任。","body":["澳大利亞自由黨一名候選人在競選活動中就性別平等進行表態時，遭到部分觀眾噓聲。現場反應顯示選民對政黨在性別議題上的承諾持懷疑態度，競選活動一度陷入尷尬。","自由黨近年來在女性議員比例、性別薪酬差距和家庭暴力應對等問題上受到持續批評。反對者認為，該黨雖有政策宣示，但制度上尚未形成真正的性別平等文化，女性在黨內高層仍屬少數。","競選中的噓聲未必反映完整民意，卻揭示出性別議題已成為澳大利亞政治中難以迴避的試金石。政黨若只口頭上支持平等，可能失去女性選民支持，並在選舉中付出實際代價。"],"why":"競選場合通常經過安排，公開噓聲透露出該黨在性別平等上的信用赤字已被選民直接表達。","en":{"t":"Australian Liberal candidate booed while pitching gender equality","d":"A Liberal candidate in Australia was booed by the audience while making a gender equality pitch during an election campaign.","body":["During an Australian election event, a Liberal candidate faced boos when addressing gender equality, signaling public distrust of the party's commitment.","The Liberal Party has faced criticism over women's representation and domestic violence policies. The incident shows that gender equality has become a contentious issue in Australian politics."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"The Canberra Times","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNaHhtR3VhZm0ySmRYMlY0SWpxb3puWWxLVFRzMDVGU1JPc2M5X2dOVVRfN0xHelNnWk1NTlZ3a2ZpZldfVXlQYVpGYXdkOV83cGlhbklVYWlDUTJ5M3VYNkJGM3AyQkl0d3R5S0Z5YkQ5LWRqRkxUejUtaEMyYlppVmVZNUNBaEoycUFxVDYtLUwxZnJzcURHcTJxeHY4SG8yRmlROQ?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"008-4","t":"聯合國婦女署公佈2026年印尼WEPs獎得主","d":"聯合國婦女署公佈2026年印度尼西亞女性賦權原則獎得主，表彰在職場推動性別平等的企業。該獎鼓勵私營部門採取具體措施支持女性發展。","body":["聯合國婦女署公佈2026年印度尼西亞女性賦權原則（WEPs）獎得主，表彰在性別平等方面表現突出的企業。獎項覆蓋職場機會、領導力與供應鏈等類別，多家印尼企業因推行女性友好政策而獲認可。","WEPs 由聯合國婦女署與全球契約共同發起，為企業提供賦權女性的行動框架。在印尼，越來越多企業參與該倡議，但性別薪酬差距和管理層女性比例仍待改善，中小企業對於系統性改革仍缺乏資源。","企業獲獎提升了性別平等在商界的可見度，但如何防止獎項淪為公關包裝，需要外部審計與持續承諾。獲獎不是終點，而是企業需要繼續接受公眾檢驗的起點。"],"why":"企業性別平等常被當作品牌宣傳，獲獎名單背後的實際政策是否落實，外界很難知曉。","en":{"t":"UN Women announces 2026 WEPs Awards winners in Indonesia","d":"UN Women announced the winners of the 2026 Women's Empowerment Principles Awards in Indonesia, recognizing companies for gender equality efforts.","body":["The 2026 WEPs Awards in Indonesia honored companies for promoting gender equality in workplace opportunity, leadership, and supply chains.","While more Indonesian companies join the WEPs initiative, gender pay gaps and low female representation in management remain challenges. The awards need to avoid becoming mere public relations tools."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png","src":"RM.ID","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPT05lRGNLR0htQ2hSeXNLNm5hZXA5Ui1mV0xpbXhrR0J4czV3djEtdzRrcTR0ZUhPTnFNVUVjZDVRR1E3bmx4bW1JYVVsVEhrSDY4eVBmRTlFdEtaaEhTc3RnaldxNS1PUzB4cDFWRldnMWFVajZjT2haRDl6ZDRldmZicVhwZTVQSnF0OWdHMW9hTGNKZ2Zka2JXVDU?oc=5","region":"東南亞"},{"id":"008-5","t":"喀拉拉邦托迪酒鋪向女性開放工作權","d":"印度喀拉拉邦的托迪酒鋪開始向女性開放工作機會，挑戰該行業長期由男性主導的傳統。這一變化與女性就業權擴展相關。","body":["印度喀拉拉邦的托迪酒鋪近日向女性開放工作權，允許女性進入這一傳統上由男性主導的行業。此前，相關崗位通常不面向女性，招聘廣告中往往明確限定男性。","印度許多邦對女性從事酒精銷售和夜間工作有嚴格限制，部分因歷史保護性立法，實際也限制了女性的就業選擇。喀拉拉邦在女性識字率和勞動參與率上曾表現較好，但女性正規就業比例並不高，行業隔離仍然明顯。","向女性開放此類工作既是權利延伸，也可能引發關於安全與道德爭議。支持者認為應保障女性自由選擇，反對者擔憂工作環境風險。這一爭議反映出社會對女性職業選擇權的雙重標準。"],"why":"酒鋪工作常被視為“不適合女性”，這條新聞打破了職業性別隔離裡的一小塊磚。","en":{"t":"Kerala toddy shops open doors to women's right to work","d":"Toddy shops in Kerala, India, have begun opening jobs to women, challenging male dominance in the trade.","body":["Women in Kerala can now apply for work at toddy shops, a sector traditionally closed to them.","Protective laws in India often restrict women's employment in alcohol-related and night work. This change is a test of whether women can choose such jobs freely despite safety concerns."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png","src":"Urban Acres","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNTTZOZ3h6V3ZwQ3E0THp0cGhBUS00T0JDbjBvWUFmOWp1RWdzT2k3dDNUMVFPcXZtLTFfVWFIT2VzTkh0VHgxaGRmRG4zYUxxREowdEczdWx6MURPbEdBclV3d09GRU1ZMElFQnhBclRxbHpGaHJ3YjFzZFB3eUdURQ?oc=5","region":"南亞"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"008-6","t":"美國多州女性權益相關選票措施受關注","d":"美國佐治亞、俄亥俄、明尼蘇達等州的選票措施成為女性權益倡導者關注焦點，涉及墮胎權、投票權與性別平等條款。中期選舉結果將影響政策走向。","body":["美國佐治亞州、俄亥俄州、明尼蘇達州等地的選票措施成為女性權益與民主倡導者關注重點。這些措施涉及墮胎權、投票權及性別平等相關條款，各州選民將通過直接投票決定是否修改州法。","在聯邦層面墮胎權保護被削弱後，各州通過直接民主方式決定是否保留或擴大生育權利。中西部和南部多州出現激烈拉鋸，倡議團體投入大量資源動員選民，尤其是年輕女性和郊區選民。","州級選票結果不僅決定當地法律，還將影響2028年大選議程與最高法院相關案件的輿論氣候。每一次州級公投都在重塑美國生育權利的地理版圖，也考驗草根動員能否抵抗保守立法。"],"why":"墮胎權本被視為既定權利，如今卻要一個州一個州地投票重新確認，這種倒退本身就很反常。","en":{"t":"US state ballot measures on women's rights draw attention","d":"Ballot measures in Georgia, Ohio, Minnesota and other states are being closely watched by women's rights advocates, covering abortion and voting rights.","body":["Voters in several US states will decide ballot measures related to abortion rights, voting access, and gender equality.","After federal abortion protections were weakened, state-level direct democracy has become a key battleground. Results will shape reproductive rights and political momentum for years."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"Ms. Magazine","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQLTZwWXFScVhMMHRubVJDMTNWeElDNE1ua2pfNlJ4bkhsTjM2Q3p4Zy1rRjJIWjFFMUJHcXh1RUdrZHZoTUpxaHYxTXhuV01zYnRqbUE5WU05UU1EUV9TUU4wWHkzbnRMb3B0SzFUZTBIaDVJNmlaby1ZTzY3YnhKb1hicFpwQmlULXd4RGZsc2pNUnNUdmc5aWRQcTZuN1k?oc=5","region":"北美"},{"id":"008-7","t":"墨西哥參議院肯定米卻肯州推進性與生殖權利","d":"墨西哥參議院在論壇上肯定米卻肯州在女性性權利和生殖權利方面的工作。此舉被視為地方與聯邦在墮胎及健康政策上協同的信號。","body":["墨西哥參議院在一次論壇中肯定了米卻肯州在女性性與生殖權利方面所做的努力。論壇討論了地方政策與聯邦框架的銜接，米卻肯州代表介紹了擴大服務可及性的具體做法。","墨西哥近年來部分州逐步放寬墮胎限制，但各州法律差異仍大。米卻肯州推動相關服務的可及性，被視為墨西哥聯邦制下進步政策的地方實踐，為其他保守州提供了參照。","參議院公開背書可能為其他州提供示範，但也面臨保守力量反對。性權利與生殖健康服務的實際落地仍需資源和基層執行，否則可能停留在論壇上的口頭肯定。"],"why":"在一個天主教文化深厚的國家，地方政府公開推進生殖權利本身就需要承擔政治風險。","en":{"t":"Mexican Senate recognizes Michoacán's efforts on sexual and reproductive rights","d":"The Mexican Senate recognized Michoacán state's work on women's sexual and reproductive rights during a forum.","body":["The Mexican Senate praised Michoacán's efforts to advance sexual and reproductive rights for women, highlighting coordination between state and federal policies.","Abortion access varies widely across Mexican states. Recognition from the Senate could encourage other states, though implementation still faces resource and political challenges."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"El Congresista","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQ0R2c05sdWtrck1EQVV6UE1QYVFmVXNpMXF3NHJfdTl5WW5BVnJWVlBKQVZsQWhGdDVST01oUjZRWnZ2aS14SjNKQ1FrYmxuWmRMWDBhcWtJeElKZ0R2VXJ1WVdBd3owbDJDeEdwUTBELVJOeFNXWldKeEJUVEZ6ZC0wV2c?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"文化","en_cat":"Culture","items":[{"id":"008-8","t":"金子文子反抗歧視題材電影在沖繩重映","d":"以日本女性金子文子為主角的電影將在沖繩市再次上映，並舉辦映後座談。影片描繪她反抗歧視與不公的經歷，呼應女性抗爭主題。","body":["一部以金子文子為主角的電影將在沖繩市再次上映，放映後安排座談活動。影片講述她面對社會歧視與壓迫時的反抗，主創和研究者將與觀眾交流。","金子文子是20世紀初日本的無政府主義者，因參與反抗活動而被捕，後死於獄中。她的故事長期被邊緣化，近年通過影像和文學被重新發掘，成為討論女性與權力結構的素材。","電影重映不只關乎歷史，也連接當下：女性對結構性不公的反抗，在不同時代以不同形式延續。沖繩作為曾受歧視與軍事化影響的地方，為重映增添了現實註腳。"],"why":"一個世紀前的女性反抗者被現在的電影重新講述，說明她的經驗尚未過時。","en":{"t":"Film about Kaneko Fumiko's resistance re-screened in Okinawa","d":"A film about Japanese woman Kaneko Fumiko, who resisted discrimination and oppression, will be re-screened in Okinawa City with talk sessions.","body":["The film depicting Kaneko Fumiko's resistance against discrimination will be shown again in Okinawa City, accompanied by post-screening discussions.","Kaneko Fumiko, an early 20th-century Japanese anarchist, died in prison. Her story has been rediscovered in recent years, linking past struggles to current feminist resistance."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"沖縄タイムス社","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBVWTBiNmJrQzhDR20zR0plREpaSW1JLTl4TGVtQlozVFF1MjVPVUdMZzI1M3VSbVBfdWpEb2kxbmZSYjZUdE44RFBacUJFYmtiSmg3OEdsNXJVVjdPN3c?oc=5","region":"東亞"}]},{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"008-9","t":"也門婦女委員會呼籲國際行動解除塔伊茲圍困","d":"也門全國婦女委員會敦促國際社會採取緊急行動解除塔伊茲圍困，並停止針對婦女兒童的侵犯。圍困已加劇當地人道危機。","body":["也門全國婦女委員會呼籲國際社會緊急介入，解除對塔伊茲的圍困，並要求停止針對婦女和兒童的侵犯行為。聲明指出持續衝突嚴重侵害女性權益，使她們無法獲得基本安全與醫療。","塔伊茲長期處於交戰方包圍之中，物資進入受限，醫療、食品短缺，婦女兒童首當其衝。人道組織多次警告當地狀況惡化，孕產婦和新生兒死亡率上升，暴力事件頻發。","婦女委員會的呼籲將性別視角帶入衝突敘事，但國際響應往往受地緣政治制約。如何讓人道保護不被武器化，確保婦女參與和平進程，仍需持續施壓。"],"why":"當城市被圍困時，最先被忽視的往往是婦女的醫療與安全需求，這份呼籲把它推到臺前。","en":{"t":"Yemeni women's committee urges action to lift Taiz siege","d":"Yemen's National Women's Committee called for urgent international action to lift the siege on Taiz and stop violations against women and children.","body":["The Yemeni National Women's Committee demanded international action to end the siege of Taiz and halt abuses against women and children.","The prolonged siege has caused severe shortages of food and medicine, with women and children bearing the brunt. The call aims to bring a gender perspective into conflict response."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png","src":"https://www.sabanew.net/","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE13V2ZpR1RQUmU4UXo0QlhJVWxRM1B4d1BBXzVUMUFnR3ZXS3RueHhvT1lnWU9VWTJiYUZSazhZUm1wSTcwdzZndzR3R2lPN1lE?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"008-10","t":"人權觀察：女性不應在分娩時被銬住","d":"人權觀察發佈報告稱，監禁中的女性不應在分娩時被鎖鏈束縛，呼籲廢除這一侵犯人權的做法。","body":["人權觀察發佈聲明或報告指出，女性在監禁期間分娩時被使用鐐銬，這種做法應被禁止。報告呼籲各國監獄系統停止對孕婦和產後婦女使用束縛，保障其安全與尊嚴。","在美國多個州，法律曾允許或未明確禁止對在押分娩女性使用鐐銬，儘管醫學組織長期警告其危害。近年部分州已立法限制，但執行不均衡，聯邦監獄與地方看守所標準也存在差異。","分娩時使用鐐銬不僅關乎醫療安全，更觸及尊嚴與平等對待。監禁不應成為剝奪基本人權的理由，對孕產婦的約束措施必須接受嚴格審查和公眾監督。"],"why":"女性在人生最脆弱的時刻仍被當作危險對象鎖住，這種畫面極少被公開討論。","en":{"t":"Women should never give birth in shackles, says Human Rights Watch","d":"Human Rights Watch stated that incarcerated women should not be shackled during childbirth, calling for an end to the practice.","body":["Human Rights Watch has called for a ban on shackling pregnant women during labor and childbirth in prisons.","Despite medical warnings, many jurisdictions still allow the practice. The report urges states to ensure dignified and safe childbirth for incarcerated women."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"Human Rights Watch","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNODVyUEk1RmZMdXNWbVdUeGc3Z3dLdmtkWU5LVkJUaUxlVTVFeFZyeE9GbktHbjNZclR4R2FRSUZ1OVNfSENCLU4yTzUydEQ2eGRnNC1mTzFJYW9rcXpRSUpPbWZQQmVCbzB5bk8xUi1YVVJHSzJFdF9RT203czU1aVVYUQ?oc=5","region":"全球"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"008-11","t":"洪都拉斯人權部舉辦女性權利主題講座","d":"洪都拉斯人權部舉辦了一場關於女性權利的講座，旨在提升公眾對暴力侵害婦女和性別平等的認識。","body":["洪都拉斯人權部舉辦了一場關於女性權利的講座，面向公眾普及女性權益相關知識。活動內容包括法律保護、暴力預防和求助渠道，政府代表和社區成員參與。","洪都拉斯長期面臨高女性被殺率和家庭暴力問題，儘管有專門立法，執法與司法保護仍薄弱。此類官方講座是擴大意識的一種手段，但無法替代結構性改革與資源投入。","單次講座無法改變結構性問題，但若能與基層服務和司法改革銜接，可能成為改善女性處境的起點。否則容易停留在宣傳層面，難以觸及真正需要幫助的女性。"],"why":"在暴力率極高的國家，官方出面講女性權利，本身就說明問題嚴重程度。","en":{"t":"Honduras ministry holds talk on women's rights","d":"Honduras' Ministry of Human Rights held a talk on women's rights, focusing on violence prevention and gender equality awareness.","body":["The Honduran Ministry of Human Rights organized a talk on women's rights, covering legal protections, violence prevention, and support channels.","Honduras faces high rates of femicide and domestic violence. While such talks raise awareness, real change depends on law enforcement and comprehensive services."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"Canal 6 Honduras","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]}]},{"id":"007","date":"2026-10-23","period":"2026.10.19 – 2026.10.25","title":"女性權利週報：土地、身體與政治空間的爭奪","summary":"本期聚焦女性在土地、醫療、暴力與政治參與中的權利鬥爭，覆蓋非洲、大洋洲、中東、北美和拉美等地。從摩洛哥女童遇害到澳大利亞移民拘留女性被忽視，再到南非和肯尼亞的土地權爭議，展現結構性性別不平等的多重面向。","en":{"title":"Women's Rights Weekly: Struggles over Land, Body and Political Space","summary":"This issue focuses on women's struggles over land, healthcare, violence and political participation, covering Africa, Oceania, the Middle East, North America and Latin America. From a girl's killing in Morocco to neglected women in Australian immigration detention, and land rights disputes in South Africa and Kenya, it reveals structural gender inequality."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"亞歷山德里婭·奧卡西奧-科爾特斯","name_en":"Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez","role":"美國眾議員、政治人物","role_en":"U.S. Representative, Politician","region":"北美","why":"她在特朗普政府推出系列跨性別政策時公開警告，指出針對跨性別者的打壓可能演變為對全體女性公民權利的限制。她將性別身份權利與更廣泛的女性權利聯繫起來，推動了相關立法辯論。","why_en":"She publicly warned that the Trump administration's policies targeting transgender people could erode civil rights for all women, linking gender identity restrictions to broader rollbacks. Her intervention reframed the debate around the definition of sex and women's rights.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"芭比","book":"秋園","art":"陸揚"},"sections":[{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"007-1","t":"摩洛哥女童遇害，婦女權利聯盟要求最嚴厲懲罰","d":"卡薩布蘭卡機場區一名女童遇害，婦女權利聯盟譴責暴行，要求司法系統處以最嚴厲懲罰，以遏止針對女童的暴力。事件引發社會震驚，暴露兒童保護機制薄弱。","body":["摩洛哥卡薩布蘭卡“機場區”一名女童遇害，婦女權利聯盟公開要求司法機關對兇手處以最嚴厲懲罰。消息經當地媒體報道後，輿論廣泛關注。事件細節尚在調查中，但初步信息顯示女童遭受極端暴力，其死亡方式被描述為“慘案”。婦女權利組織正跟進案件，呼籲公眾不要沉默。","摩洛哥近年多次發生針對女童和女性的暴力案件，女性團體持續批評法律保護不足，執法滯後。儘管刑法對謀殺有不同程度量刑，但針對家庭內或熟人作案的暴力仍常被輕判。婦女權利聯盟長期收集類似案件，推動修法加強對未成年人和婦女的保護。","此案再次將兒童保護和性別暴力問題推向公共議程。支持者認為嚴厲司法能起威懾作用，但批評者指出僅靠重刑無法消除結構性性別不平等。如何在懲罰與預防之間取得平衡，成為摩洛哥婦女運動面臨的難題。"],"why":"一名女童以慘烈方式遇害，而兇手身份和動機有待查明，案件性質超出普通犯罪。","en":{"t":"Morocco: Women's rights group demands harshest penalties after girl's killing","d":"A girl was killed in Casablanca's airport district, and a women's rights federation is demanding the strictest punishment. The case highlights weak child protection and widespread gender-based violence.","body":["A girl was killed in the 'airport district' of Casablanca, Morocco, and a women's rights federation is publicly demanding the harshest possible punishment. Local media report broad public shock, with initial information suggesting extreme violence. The group is monitoring the case and urging people not to remain silent.","Morocco has seen repeated violent cases against girls and women, with women's groups criticizing weak legal protection and slow law enforcement. Even when murder charges are filed, violence within families or by acquaintances is often treated leniently. This case has reignited debate on child protection and how to combine punishment with prevention."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"LeSiteinfo.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"007-2","t":"伊拉克女子被父殺害，人權機構要求不以家庭糾紛定性","d":"伊拉克蘇萊曼尼亞一名女子遭父親殺害，當地人權監測機構呼籲停止將此類殺戮女性案件標籤為“家庭糾紛”，應認定為基於性別的謀殺，並追究責任。","body":["伊拉克蘇萊曼尼亞地區一名女子被其父親殺害，事件被部分輿論和當局稱為“家庭糾紛”。人權監測機構公開反對這一標籤，認為這是典型的殺戮女性（femicide），要求以謀殺罪公正調查和起訴。","在伊拉克部分地區，家族內的“榮譽殺人”或家暴致死常被司法系統降格處理，兇手可能因親屬身份獲減刑。人權組織長期指出，這種法律文化縱容了對女性的暴力，使致命攻擊被掩蓋在“家事”名目下。","命名方式影響司法走向和公共認知。將父殺女定義為“家庭糾紛”不僅淡化兇手的責任，也向其他家庭傳遞錯誤信號。改變語言和分類，是爭取女性生命權的重要一步。"],"why":"父親殺害女兒卻被輕描淡寫為“家庭糾紛”，這種定性本身掩蓋了謀殺性質。","en":{"t":"Iraq: Rights monitor says father's killing of daughter is femicide, not family dispute","d":"The killing of a woman by her father in Sulaimaniya must be treated as gender-based murder, not a 'familial dispute,' a rights monitor said, calling for proper investigation.","body":["A woman in Sulaimaniya, Iraq, was killed by her father, and some authorities and media described it as a 'family dispute.' A human rights monitor rejected that label, calling it a clear case of femicide and demanding a murder investigation and prosecution.","In parts of Iraq, so-called 'honor killings' or domestic violence deaths are often downgraded by the justice system, with perpetrators receiving reduced sentences due to family ties. Rights groups say this legal culture enables violence against women by hiding lethal attacks under the guise of 'family matters.'"]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"The New Region","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFBMbTNJT2NMVjZia1pwYUliTnpxM2dDMnluSkZGQTRmQ2p6c09BTktTZHlUV2pfYlpIZVY5WVIxcmloS0V3d3RIVHBOTQ?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"007-3","t":"澳大利亞檢查發現移民拘留中的女性仍被忽視","d":"澳大利亞人權委員會後續檢查顯示，移民拘留體系中的女性仍處於制度盲區，基本醫療、安全與尊嚴保障不足，委員會呼籲立即改革。","body":["澳大利亞人權委員會發布後續檢查報告，指出女性在移民拘留中仍被當作“事後才想到的群體”。她們在獲得經期用品、隱私保護、心理健康支持和安全住宿方面面臨持續障礙，許多人報告恐懼與無助。","此前檢查已發現類似問題，但改善有限。女性被拘留者中不少是尋求庇護者或簽證逾期者，因非刑事原因被長期關押。拘留中心設計以男性為主，缺乏性別敏感服務，孕產婦和創傷倖存者處境尤為艱難。","這份報告再次引發對移民拘留制度的合法性爭議。批評者認為拘留本身對女性造成二次傷害，尤其當她們並未對公共安全構成威脅。保障被拘留女性基本權利，是移民政策不可迴避的人道底線。"],"why":"檢查報告用“afterthought”（事後才被想起）形容女性，說明制度設計初期就未考慮女性需求。","en":{"t":"Australia: Women in immigration detention remain an afterthought, inspection finds","d":"A follow-up inspection by the Australian Human Rights Commission finds women in immigration detention still lack adequate healthcare, privacy and safety, calling for urgent reform.","body":["The Australian Human Rights Commission's follow-up inspection found that women in immigration detention continue to be treated as an afterthought. They face persistent barriers in accessing menstrual products, privacy, mental health support and safe accommodation, with many reporting fear and helplessness.","Earlier inspections identified similar problems, but improvements have been limited. Many detained women are asylum seekers or visa overstayers held for non-criminal reasons. Detention centers are largely designed for men, lacking gender-sensitive services, and pregnant women and trauma survivors face particularly harsh conditions."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Australian Human Rights Commission","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"},{"id":"007-4","t":"澳洲性別歧視專員：現行法律未能保護母親","d":"澳大利亞性別歧視專員指出，反性別歧視法律在孕期歧視、育兒負擔和職場排斥方面保護不足，母親群體面臨制度性失敗。","body":["澳大利亞性別歧視專員公開表示，現行反性別歧視法律未能有效保護母親。許多女性在懷孕、休產假或重返職場時遭遇歧視，卻難以通過法律途徑獲得救濟，投訴門檻高、賠償有限。","儘管澳大利亞有《性別歧視法》，但實際執行中，母親在招聘、晉升和工作安排上仍處劣勢。僱主常以“業務需要”為由規避責任，法律對間接歧視和結構性偏見的認定標準嚴苛，導致維權者望而卻步。","專員的批評直指法律與現實的落差。當生育成為女性職場懲罰的起點，性別平等立法若不能回應母職懲罰，就只是紙面權利。法律改革需要降低舉證難度，並將照顧責任納入反歧視框架。"],"why":"專員罕見承認法律“失敗”，說明現有條文對母親保護並不足以對抗職場現實。","en":{"t":"Australia: Sex discrimination laws are failing mothers, commissioner says","d":"Australia's sex discrimination commissioner says current laws fail mothers, with pregnancy and parental discrimination persisting and legal remedies hard to obtain.","body":["Australia's Sex Discrimination Commissioner has publicly stated that current anti-discrimination laws are failing mothers. Many women face discrimination when pregnant, on parental leave or returning to work, but find it difficult to obtain legal remedies due to high barriers to complaints and limited compensation.","Despite Australia's Sex Discrimination Act, mothers remain disadvantaged in hiring, promotion and workplace arrangements. Employers often evade responsibility by citing 'business needs,' and the strict tests for indirect discrimination and structural bias deter many from seeking justice. The commissioner's criticism highlights the gap between law and reality."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"ABC News & Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPcVNtTUY4TmlYN3REcTRTTzJFdnhfakFlTVhoenljX1hMZGgtbE9hN3Qwc1o4WnJuTEd2Zmpjcmc1NS1SWG4tbTNJUWdxUFBUUThUdnVWMjdPLWZ0bVczQVdpRVlhaGFaNjN3cEdqM0xDd193MjBlTmwxM29kLWJMUWZvZHA5TlNCbDhtM2lUZlV6Y3JxdWRidUpmU2I2UmlMblQ0TVotbnVmZk5OUHFoQXh3MA?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"},{"id":"007-5","t":"AOC警告特朗普跨性別政策或威脅女性民權","d":"美國眾議員亞歷山德里婭·奧卡西奧-科爾特斯表示，將跨性別者作為目標的政策可能侵蝕所有女性的公民權利，引發對性別平等的擔憂。","body":["美國眾議員亞歷山德里婭·奧卡西奧-科爾特斯（AOC）公開警告，特朗普政府針對跨性別者的政策可能並非孤立行動，而會波及其他女性的公民權利。她指出，“針對跨性別者”的行政舉措正在製造恐懼，並可能為限制更廣泛女性權利鋪路。","特朗普執政期間，聯邦層面試圖重新定義性別、限制跨性別者使用公共設施和參與體育，這些政策引發大量法律挑戰。AOC認為，當國家把性別本質化並壓縮性別表達空間時，所有不符合傳統性別角色的女性都可能成為審查對象。","AOC的言論凸顯跨性別權利與女性權利之間的複雜關聯。支持者認為保護跨性別女性不會削弱順性別女性權益，而是擴展自由邊界；反對者則堅持單性別空間需要生物標準。爭議背後是性別定義權的爭奪。"],"why":"一位知名女性議員把跨性別政策和女性民權聯繫起來，指出攻擊一個群體可能危及其他群體。","en":{"t":"AOC warns Trump's transgender policies could threaten women's civil rights","d":"U.S. Representative Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez said policies targeting transgender people could erode civil rights for all women, linking gender identity restrictions to broader rollbacks.","body":["U.S. Representative Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez warned that the Trump administration's policies targeting transgender people are not isolated but could spill over into the civil rights of all women. She said such measures create fear and could pave the way for broader restrictions on women's rights.","During the Trump era, federal attempts to redefine gender and restrict transgender people's access to public facilities and sports sparked legal challenges. AOC argues that when the state enforces a narrow biological definition of sex, all women who do not fit traditional gender roles become subject to scrutiny."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"The Economic Times","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"北美"},{"id":"007-6","t":"南非土地改革委員會呼籲強化婦女土地權利","d":"南非議會土地改革委員會表示，現行改革措施對婦女土地權保障不足，需採取更有力行動，確保女性平等獲得土地和資源。","body":["南非議會土地改革委員會公開呼籲，在土地改革中採取更有力行動保障婦女土地權利。委員會指出，儘管憲法和多項法律承認性別平等，但女性在土地獲取、所有權登記和繼承方面仍面臨巨大障礙。","南非土地分配長期受殖民和種族隔離影響，黑人女性處境最為脆弱。習慣法常將土地歸於男性戶主，寡婦和單身女性常因傳統規範失去土地。政府改革方案若忽視性別維度，可能加劇不平等。","土地不僅是生產資料，也是居住安全、食物來源和身份基礎。委員會呼籲將婦女土地權納入改革核心指標，並配套法律援助和性別預算。能否落實婦女土地權，考驗南非承諾的社會轉型是否覆蓋最邊緣群體。"],"why":"官方委員會主動承認改革對婦女土地權保障不足，這種自我批評在政策領域少見。","en":{"t":"South Africa: Land Reform Committee calls for stronger action on women's land rights","d":"The South African Parliament's Land Reform Committee says current reforms fail women, urging stronger measures to ensure equal access to land and resources.","body":["The South African Parliament's Land Reform Committee has publicly called for stronger action to secure women's land rights. It said that despite constitutional and legal commitments to gender equality, women still face major obstacles in land access, title registration and inheritance.","Land allocation in South Africa has long been shaped by colonialism and apartheid, leaving Black women especially vulnerable. Customary law often assigns land to male household heads, and widows or single women frequently lose land due to traditional norms. The Committee wants women's land rights integrated into core reform indicators with legal aid and gender budgeting."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Parliament of the Republic of South Africa","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOZUY3OWZMTWFhcUVlcmJ1Q1dGUk43Tkt5bkhmRGJCUUxXVjFmeE9fZVVGZ0lrMzBGbXZjRlZDVEF2cnBpTUwtNUVEbmxPRzBtaWo2OWl5cHlhbVlxVWVRYUJ0cDFibGJuZlZoT2lUbkxYaFZKdV83NTVOZkszaGZ6NUxXUEpHdFNqODZQa2cyMTQ5Uy1hX3BGUjdBT1RLdw?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"007-7","t":"墨西哥奇瓦瓦培訓公職人員預防婦女政治暴力","d":"墨西哥奇瓦瓦市政府培訓公職人員，提高預防和應對婦女政治暴力的能力，落實保護女性參政權利的承諾。","body":["墨西哥奇瓦瓦市政府對公職人員進行專項培訓，內容聚焦預防和處理針對婦女的政治暴力。培訓旨在讓公務員識別性別暴力形式、掌握投訴渠道，並在公共事務中避免歧視性言論和行為。","墨西哥女性參政比例雖逐步提高，但政治暴力事件頻發，包括威脅、誹謗、強制辭職和人身攻擊。聯邦和州法律已定義政治性別暴力，但基層執行不力，公職人員缺乏性別敏感度，導致受害者投訴無門。","地方政府的培訓是落實法律的第一步，但象徵意義大於實質的風險也存在。若缺乏後續監督和制裁機制，培訓可能流於形式。婦女政治暴力的減少，最終取決於權力結構是否真正向女性開放。"],"why":"政府主動培訓公職人員識別政治性別暴力，說明官方承認這一問題在基層普遍存在。","en":{"t":"Mexico: Chihuahua trains public servants to prevent violence against women in politics","d":"The Municipality of Chihuahua is training public servants to prevent and respond to political violence against women, aiming to protect women's participation in politics.","body":["The municipality of Chihuahua, Mexico, is training public servants on preventing and responding to political violence against women. The training aims to help officials recognize gender-based violence, know complaint channels, and avoid discriminatory speech and behavior in public affairs.","Women's political participation in Mexico is increasing, but political violence remains frequent, including threats, defamation, forced resignation and physical attacks. Although federal and state laws define political gender violence, enforcement is weak at the local level, and many officials lack gender sensitivity, leaving victims without recourse."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Municipio Chihuahua","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"007-8","t":"新西蘭倡議：女性有權知曉乳房密度","d":"活動人士和慈善機構呼籲政府支持，確保所有接受乳腺篩查的女性獲知其乳房密度信息，以便評估乳腺癌風險和選擇進一步檢查。","body":["新西蘭乳腺篩查活動人士發起倡議，稱女性“有權知道”自己的乳房密度。高密度乳腺組織會降低X光篩查的敏感性，增加漏診風險，但許多女性至今未被告知這一指標。慈善機構呼籲政界介入。","乳房密度是乳腺癌風險因素之一，緻密型乳房在X光片中呈白色，可能掩蓋腫瘤。部分國家已立法或制定指南，要求篩查機構向受檢者提供密度信息，但新西蘭尚未形成統一強制規定，信息告知取決於不同地區做法。","支持者認為，知情權是患者自主決策的基礎，女性應根據自身風險決定是否接受補充超聲或MRI。反對者擔憂過度檢查引發焦慮和資源浪費，但隱匿信息可能讓高風險女性錯過早期診斷。政策辯論仍在繼續。"],"why":"一項影響乳腺癌檢出率的關鍵指標，卻長期不告知受檢女性，信息不對稱令人意外。","en":{"t":"New Zealand: Campaigners say women have the right to know their breast density","d":"Campaigners and a charity are calling for political support to ensure women receiving breast screening are told their breast density, which affects cancer detection.","body":["Breast screening campaigners in New Zealand say women have the right to know their breast density. High-density breast tissue can reduce the sensitivity of X-ray screening and increase the risk of missed cancers, yet many women are not informed of this metric. A charity is urging political parties to take action.","Breast density is a known risk factor for breast cancer, as dense tissue appears white on X-rays and can mask tumors. Some countries have laws or guidelines requiring screening services to provide density information, but New Zealand has no uniform requirement, and practice varies by region. Supporters argue that informed consent is fundamental, while opponents worry about over-testing and anxiety."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"The Press","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"},{"id":"007-9","t":"巴西乳腺癌宣傳月：議會提案保障女性患者權利","d":"巴西聖路易斯市議會借“粉紅十月”討論乳腺癌患者權利提案，涉及治療期間的工作保障、假髮提供和心理支持等內容。","body":["巴西聖路易斯市議會在“粉紅十月”乳腺癌宣傳月期間，提出多項保障乳腺癌女性患者權利的提案。提案內容涉及治療期間的工作保障、假髮等醫療輔助用品提供以及心理支持服務。","乳腺癌是巴西女性常見癌症，治療過程漫長且昂貴，許多女性因化療脫髮、身體虛弱而遭受就業歧視或社會孤立。現行公共醫療雖提供部分治療，但輔助支持如假髮、義乳和心理諮詢尚未納入普遍權利。","地方議會提案若通過，將在市級層面為患者建立更系統的支持網絡。支持者認為，癌症治療應被視為完整的社會權利而非單純醫療問題。反對者可能擔憂財政負擔，但支持者強調預防性支持能減少長期社會成本。"],"why":"提案聚焦治療期間的具體需求如假髮和心理支持，而非僅談篩查，展現出對患者尊嚴的細緻關注。","en":{"t":"Brazil: Breast cancer month sees proposals to protect patients' rights","d":"In Brazil's 'Pink October', São Luís city council discusses proposals to guarantee rights for women undergoing breast cancer treatment, including work protection and support aids.","body":["During 'Pink October' breast cancer awareness month, the São Luís city council in Brazil is discussing proposals to guarantee rights for women undergoing breast cancer treatment. The proposals include job protection during treatment, provision of wigs and other aids, and psychological support services.","Breast cancer is common among Brazilian women, and treatment is long and costly. Many women face employment discrimination or social isolation due to chemotherapy hair loss and physical weakness. While the public health system covers some treatment, aids like wigs, prostheses and counseling are not yet universal rights. The local proposals aim to close that gap."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"Câmara Municipal de São Luís","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"文化","en_cat":"Culture","items":[{"id":"007-10","t":"休斯頓紀念女權活動人士壁畫再次遭破壞","d":"美國休斯頓高地一幅紀念女性權利活動家的壁畫再次遭到塗鴉破壞，當地警方已介入，活動人士譴責針對女性歷史記憶的攻擊。","body":["美國休斯頓高地一幅紀念女性權利活動家的壁畫再次被人為破壞。這不是該壁畫第一次遭塗鴉，此前已修復過。這次破壞發生在上次事件後不久，社區成員和藝術家表示失望與憤怒。","該壁畫描繪的是一位在當地推動女性權利的歷史人物（名稱未在報道中詳細說明）。公共藝術常成為社會價值衝突的靶子，涉及女性、少數族裔或LGBTQ+主題的壁畫尤其容易遭到蓄意損毀。","壁畫的反覆被毀不只關乎財產損失，更反映部分人對女性公共記憶的敵意。支持者認為應加強保護並公開譴責，也有人主張通過教育消除偏見。公共空間中的女性形象能否被接納，是性別平等的直觀標尺。"],"why":"同一幅壁畫多次遭破壞，說明攻擊並非偶發，而是有針對性的持續行為。","en":{"t":"Houston mural honoring women's rights activist vandalized again","d":"A mural honoring a women's rights activist in Houston Heights has been vandalized again, sparking condemnation and police investigation.","body":["A mural honoring a women's rights activist in Houston Heights, Texas, has been vandalized again. This is not the first time the mural has been defaced; it was previously repaired. Community members and artists expressed disappointment and anger.","The mural depicts a local historical figure who advanced women's rights. Public art often becomes a target in social value conflicts, and murals featuring women, minorities or LGBTQ+ themes are especially vulnerable to deliberate damage. Repeated vandalism reflects hostility toward women's public memory, not just property crime."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Houston Chronicle","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNeVE5X012cmgtTzlIaUxLbmprRTUzT2l5WXRHUXVZLW42UmxPa3dQQXVMamNwdHZmNFhWai1VX1lYMGNUSDB2WnN0UF9wOVppOTRvNVdrb1RfdWYyZkFlc1BsRTg2RWdvdWpRZHZqZllKOERRUWF5NjBzNE9wYnphWURBNE9xVV9melRua05qLVptVGl1VEhYY0tBUmFKam9QbE1RU0hUNkU5LUd2cE5qMzNB?oc=5","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"007-11","t":"OIC重申支持阿富汗女孩接受教育","d":"伊斯蘭合作組織重申支持阿富汗女孩教育，呼籲確保女童平等接受各級教育，國際社會持續關注阿富汗性別隔離政策。","body":["伊斯蘭合作組織（OIC）重申支持阿富汗女孩接受教育，這一表態在國際壓力持續之際發出。阿富汗事實當局限制女性教育，女孩被禁止進入中學和大學，數百萬女童學業中斷。","OIC作為伊斯蘭國家間組織，其立場具有特殊意義。此前部分國家曾以文化或宗教理由容忍限制性政策，但越來越多成員承認教育與伊斯蘭教義並不衝突。OIC內部對是否承認阿富汗當局存在分歧，表態力度仍待觀察。","阿富汗女孩教育問題是全球性別平等的標誌性危機。OIC的表態若不能轉化為具體外交槓桿，實際效果有限。如何在尊重主權與維護基本權利之間施壓，是國際社會面臨的持續難題。"],"why":"一個伊斯蘭國家間組織公開支持女孩教育，這本身就打破了“文化相對主義”的沉默。","en":{"t":"OIC reaffirms support for girls' education in Afghanistan","d":"The Organization of Islamic Cooperation has reaffirmed its support for girls' education in Afghanistan, where restrictions keep millions out of school.","body":["The Organization of Islamic Cooperation (OIC) has reaffirmed its support for girls' education in Afghanistan amid ongoing international pressure. Afghan authorities restrict female education, barring girls from secondary schools and universities, leaving millions out of school.","As an intergovernmental body of Islamic states, the OIC's stance carries particular weight. While some members have previously tolerated restrictive policies citing culture or religion, a growing number now acknowledge that education does not conflict with Islamic teachings. The OIC's internal divisions over recognizing Afghan authorities may limit the impact of its statement."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png","src":"8AM Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNSEFHU3c5SktZYkJZeUIzTEo2OVA4SFdmWkdnUWE0Tm5xMndnOC0zMXk1bmkzMUdTZWJUX3pUSEg1bmdoc0V2UVFWUjgxS3JhOFo4ckt0WGlqTnVNSy1HczRYdzU1UlFIZDlsQndBTWlyWldaZnVGc0MtME5jNGd4YVFxbkV2QQ?oc=5","region":"南亞"}]}]},{"id":"006","date":"2026-10-16","period":"2026.10.12 – 2026.10.18","title":"全球女性議題週報：制度指標、職場與生育權利","summary":"本期從韓國、日本、東南亞、中東、非洲、南亞與拉美選取九則報道，涉及性別平等指標、農業職場、委員會代表性、庫爾德女性聲音、生殖健康與生育選擇、墨西哥結構性暴力預防，呈現女性權益在制度與日常中的推進與阻力。","en":{"title":"Weekly Brief: Gender Equality in Local Governance, Workplaces, and Reproductive Autonomy","summary":"This edition selects nine reports from East Asia, Southeast Asia, the Middle East, Africa, South Asia, and Latin America, covering gender equality indicators, farming careers, committee representation, Kurdish women's voice, reproductive health, and structural violence prevention."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"Ilham Ahmed","name_en":"Ilham Ahmed","role":"庫爾德女性政治人物","role_en":"Kurdish political figure","region":"中東","why":"她在採訪中同時談論政治一體化、女性角色與庫爾德權利，指出穩定議程可能壓縮女性已獲得的公共空間。這種將性別與族群議題置於地緣政治中的表達，在主流報道中少見，值得關注。","why_en":"She publicly linked political integration to weakened women's roles and Kurdish rights, highlighting how stability agendas can erode gains for marginalized groups.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNa29SN0ozSHNTN1FXZmtORW1maXRZcmFBQzF1bTRtdk4tVlNJelJORU5SeVNsZDlpMVJHcU41X0tRdThMZWNseS16RVp2b1g0SkNib0VrTmN0aEx0UktUTmIwZDgwOVE3aXF2M1lZVDhvVE12U1l2ajR4TkJqOXBrdmVOZUR4YnowcERObERXdDRiVVloeHNjUTd5QXpWRW5KbkpzY05OMHlBQzhVM0E?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"出走的決心","book":"第二性","art":"路易絲·布爾喬亞"},"sections":[{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"006-1","t":"韓國全南女性家族財團辦論壇，推議會與市民共建性別平等","d":"全南女性家族財團舉辦論壇，討論在地方行政整合中如何使議會與市民共同參與性別平等議題，推動地方性別主流化。","body":["全南女性家族財團近期舉辦一場公開論壇，主題為“議會與市民共同打造性別平等全南光州廣域特別市”。該論壇把地方議會、市民團體和關注性別議題的人士聚在一起，討論如何將性別平等原則帶入地方行政整合的決策與執行中。","全南與光州正在推進行政整合，性別平等是其中的一項重要議程。女性家族財團作為地方公共機構，試圖通過論壇收集現場意見，避免整合方案只討論行政區劃和財政，而忽略女性在公共服務、就業和照護中的實際需求。","地方行政整合往往優先考慮效率與經濟發展，性別議題容易被邊緣化。此次論壇讓性別平等成為可見的討論對象，也提醒決策者：整合不只是合併機構，更應重新分配資源，使女性在不同層級的治理中真實參與。"],"why":"地方行政整合議題中專門討論性別平等並不多見，且同時邀請議會與市民參與，形式直接。","en":{"t":"Jeonnam Women & Family Foundation Holds Forum on Gender Equality in City Integration","d":"A South Korean women's foundation organized a forum to involve local councils and citizens in gender equality issues during administrative integration.","body":["Jeonnam Women & Family Foundation recently held a public forum titled 'Building a Gender-Equal Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated City with Councils and Citizens.' The event brought together local council members, civic groups, and residents to discuss how gender equality can be embedded in the administrative merger.","Administrative integration often prioritizes efficiency and economic development, leaving gender issues on the margins. By creating a space for dialogue, the forum makes gender equality visible and urges policymakers to allocate resources so that women can genuinely participate in local governance."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"여수넷통뉴스","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5nSWZlUU5mWVZiblNUc0QyZHB5ZmxHeDFnWXJTQ3NHMVR3Z3l2WFdVZ0p5RTNXaVlPZWlHVnJkMlRUcWlSLWZvVGttNXMwNXRmSjVtUEJpa1Q2QzRNWmVSanBzdzByaDVzWXc?oc=5","region":"東亞"},{"id":"006-2","t":"印尼政治人物批評性別平等指標只聚焦高層職位","d":"印度尼西亞有聲音指出，現有性別平等指標過度關注高層領導崗位，忽視基層女性在教育、健康和非正規就業中的處境。","body":["印度尼西亞政治人物 Heri Pudyatmoko 公開表示，當前使用的性別平等指標過於聚焦高層職位，難以反映普通女性的真實狀況。他認為，僅以領導層女性比例衡量進展存在明顯侷限。","許多性別平等評估確實把女性在議會、企業高管等崗位的比例作為核心標準，這容易導致公共資源和政策注意力集中在少數精英女性身上，而教育機會、健康服務、非正規就業和基層參與等更廣泛領域被忽視。","批評者認為，性別平等不應被簡化為高層數字。重新設計指標，將基層女性的就業、安全和決策參與納入衡量，有助於讓政策惠及更多女性，避免性別議程變成精英化改革。"],"why":"性別平等評估常被高層女性比例綁架，基層女性的真實處境反而被指標遮蔽。","en":{"t":"Indonesian Voice Criticizes Gender Equality Indicators Focused on Top Positions","d":"An Indonesian political figure says gender equality indicators that focus only on leadership posts miss the reality of ordinary women.","body":["Indonesian political figure Heri Pudyatmoko publicly criticized gender equality indicators that overemphasize high-level positions. He argues that measuring progress mainly by the number of women in leadership ignores wider inequalities.","Such indicator design can concentrate resources on a small elite while leaving education, health, informal work, and grassroots participation underfunded. The criticism calls for measurements that reflect the daily situations of most women."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Indoraya News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOc2tNbDdvekNWVzExeE1WdnR1ODI3cjVNWkI1ck1BakpUZzRMZ2p2VlJ4R2dZZjJaQUE3S3hibVRNUHJjTUhuQjNWcVJETTZJQnRHVmsxZnNZRDhNVnlqWHBpUHc3b0pub1RJVHluREhIUS1TcndHdHBEMFo3MzhLS09PTEV5TEdwbE1nc0FlUTd4aHJzQlhTNTB0cFR0X0pGYzRjV29HMUFoSDg3ZUE?oc=5","region":"東南亞"},{"id":"006-3","t":"越南美福社接受性別平等法實施監督","d":"越南 My Phuoc 公社成為性別平等法實施監督對象，相關方面檢查基層執行情況，評估法律落地成效與障礙。","body":["越南 My Phuoc 公社近期被納入性別平等法實施監督範圍，相關方面對該基層單位的法律執行情況進行檢查。監督內容涉及性別平等政策宣傳、地方制度安排以及婦女參與公共事務的具體情況。","越南早已制定性別平等法，但在基層落實中仍面臨傳統觀念、資源不足和問責機制薄弱等障礙。許多鄉級單位缺乏專門人員和經費，法律要求容易停留在文件層面，婦女的實際處境改善有限。","對基層單位開展監督，說明法律不能只停留在紙面，而需要通過常態化評估和問責來推動執行。此次行動如果能夠形成可複製的方法，將為其他地區落實性別平等法提供參考。"],"why":"法律條文在鄉級單位是否真正生效，往往缺少公開監督，這次行動讓基層執行進入視野。","en":{"t":"Vietnam Monitors Gender Equality Law Implementation in a Commune","d":"A Vietnamese commune came under supervision to check how the gender equality law is being implemented at the grassroots.","body":["My Phuoc commune in Vietnam was recently subject to supervision over its implementation of the gender equality law. The review covered policy dissemination, institutional arrangements, and women's participation in public affairs.","Laws often face weak enforcement at the local level due to traditional attitudes and limited resources. Grassroots supervision is a key step in turning national gender equality legislation into real changes in daily life."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Vietnam.vn","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQZUtHUU5TaTVIdGlYaXRwVU1QbHlCaFpuSG9vM2lBZmJpZVctV0JHMGR4QVBKZFFsOFVFWl9oMDVqMFdFUVFQZmRRMnhYZ3pmZnhtRHpBdEc2Szdkd0gwUG1yNW5NV0dEQ1d2aHFGNUFheGJUT21kMjdFZkRTX2RyaDVSVHBXdWNpNFRFXzZMQXAxQkdpSGlhRGFHUzQ?oc=5","region":"東南亞"},{"id":"006-4","t":"女性權利聯合會批評委員會主席女性代表性不足","d":"一家女性權利聯合會批評議會委員會主席職位中女性比例過低，認為決策層的性別失衡限制了女性議題進入核心議程。","body":["一家女性權利聯合會公開批評，稱議會委員會主席職位中女性代表性明顯不足。該聯合會認為，委員會主席掌握議程設置權，性別失衡意味著女性的立法關切難以被優先處理。","在部分中東和北非國家，女性在議會中的總體比例雖有所提升，但領導職位仍由男性主導。女性議員往往被分配到社會、教育等被認為“適合女性”的委員會，難以進入財政、安全等核心委員會。","代表性不足不僅是人數問題，更關係到政治權力的實際分配。該批評試圖推動制度改變，讓更多女性進入決策層，從而改變立法方向與資源分配，使性別平等不只停留在選舉口號。"],"why":"公眾常關注女性議員數量，卻忽略委員會主席這類真正掌握議程權力的職位。","en":{"t":"Women's Rights Federation Criticizes Low Female Representation in Committee Chairs","d":"A women's rights federation says too few women hold committee chair positions, weakening women's influence over legislative agendas.","body":["A women's rights federation publicly criticized the low proportion of women chairing parliamentary committees. Committee chairs control agenda-setting, so the imbalance reduces the likelihood that women's concerns will be prioritized.","In some Middle Eastern and North African countries, women's overall parliamentary presence has grown, but leadership remains male-dominated. The criticism highlights that access to top committee roles matters as much as the number of seats won."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"جورنال 24","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"中東"},{"id":"006-5","t":"Carolina Viggiano要求資源應對女性暴力結構性根源","d":"墨西哥政治人物 Carolina Viggiano 呼籲撥出資源，從結構性原因入手預防和減少針對女性的暴力，而非僅依賴事後懲處。","body":["墨西哥政治人物 Carolina Viggiano 公開呼籲，應分配更充足的資源來應對針對女性暴力的結構性原因。她指出，僅靠事後救援、起訴和懲罰無法從根本上減少暴力，必須投資於預防。","墨西哥長期面臨嚴重的女性被殺與失蹤問題，暴力根植於性別不平等、貧困、司法有罪不罰和有組織犯罪交織的環境。若干預措施只停留在案件發生後的應急響應，難以改變高發趨勢。","將資源導向結構性預防，意味著要改變教育、就業、司法和社會保障中的性別歧視。這比單一嚴懲更能觸及問題根源，也為基層女性建立更可靠的安全網。"],"why":"她明確區分了應急反應與結構性預防，指出只處理案件後果無法減少暴力。","en":{"t":"Carolina Viggiano Demands Resources for Structural Causes of Violence Against Women","d":"Mexican political figure Carolina Viggiano called for resources to address the structural causes of violence against women, not just its aftermath.","body":["Mexican political figure Carolina Viggiano publicly urged the allocation of more resources to tackle the structural causes of violence against women. She said emergency responses, prosecution, and punishment are not enough on their own.","Mexico has long faced high rates of femicide and disappearances, rooted in inequality, poverty, impunity, and organized crime. Directing resources to prevention—through education, employment, justice, and social protection—aims to build a safer environment for women."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"senado.gob","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"006-6","t":"日本舉辦農業女性研討會，討論性別平等與女性活躍","d":"日本舉行以“思考農業女性活躍、邁向性別平等”為主題的研討會，關注農村女性在農業經營中的角色與發展障礙。","body":["日本近期舉行以“思考農業女性活躍、邁向性別平等”為主題的研討會。與會者圍繞農業經營、地方經濟與女性參與展開討論，試圖找出讓女性在農村和農業領域獲得更多主導權的路徑。","日本農業人口持續減少，女性在農業勞動力中佔有相當比例，但往往被當作輔助勞動力，很少擁有土地、資金和經營決策權。性別平等政策在地方農業部門落實有限，農村女性的職業發展缺少制度支持。","農業女性的發展不僅關係個體收入，也影響地方經濟和食品安全。研討會將性別視角帶入農業政策討論，意在改變長期忽視女性貢獻的結構，推動農村社會重新認識女性的生產與經營角色。"],"why":"農業常被視為男性主導行業，專門為農業女性舉辦的性別平等研討會並不多見。","en":{"t":"Japan Symposium Focuses on Rural Women and Gender Equality in Farming","d":"A symposium in Japan examined how to boost rural women's participation and promote gender equality in agriculture.","body":["Japan recently held a symposium on women's advancement in agriculture under the theme of moving toward gender equality. Participants discussed land access, business leadership, and the structural barriers rural women face.","Rural policies and gender policies are often separate, leaving women in farming without sufficient institutional support. The event aimed to bring a gender perspective into agricultural policy and make women's contributions to rural economies more visible."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png","src":"琉球新報デジタル","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBEUGZobkp3QmZnT0NHWVY0MkRPdGsxOVZ1OGxpcFZSR0lPWXpsOXM4ZnN6WVNzWFJteVk2dkZoMk5hRFRBZWRGekN6M1AtV21ld0lWVVJNZWk3YzFE?oc=5","region":"東亞"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"006-7","t":"尼日利亞NGO呼籲各方支持女性生殖健康權利","d":"尼日利亞一家非政府組織尋求利益相關方支持，以推進女性生殖健康權利，強調生殖健康服務應被視為基本權利而非特權。","body":["尼日利亞一家非政府組織公開尋求利益相關方支持，以推進女性生殖健康權利。該組織強調，獲得避孕、安全孕產和生殖保健服務應當是女性的基本權利，不應因經濟或地域差異而受阻。","在許多非洲國家，女性獲得生殖健康服務仍面臨障礙，包括設施不足、費用高昂以及宗教和文化觀念的限制。非政府組織往往通過社區教育、政策倡導和服務提供來彌補公共體系的缺口，但資源長期有限。","將生殖健康明確定位為權利問題，有助於推動政府承擔責任，並改變社會對女性身體的傳統評判。沒有身體自主，女性在教育和就業等領域的平等就難以實現。"],"why":"生殖健康權利常被簡化成醫療問題，但該組織直接把它作為政治與社會議題提出。","en":{"t":"Nigerian NGO Seeks Support for Women's Reproductive Health Rights","d":"A Nigerian non-governmental organization called on stakeholders to support women's reproductive health rights as basic rights.","body":["A Nigerian NGO publicly sought stakeholder support to advance women's reproductive health rights. It emphasized that access to contraception, safe motherhood, and reproductive care should be treated as a basic right, not a privilege.","Many women in Africa still face barriers such as inadequate facilities, high costs, and cultural restrictions. Positioning reproductive health as a rights issue helps push governments to take responsibility and changes how society views women's bodies."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"News Agency of Nigeria","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQcGtKaFJYc2hPQXVKNHdid0c2a1o0eGlsaFlYRjI5R2dUYjZOX1RMT0tiMXdGLUNYSkZmcm5LbDhXbl9oWF81WHdReUt0WUstTHRtdHBEZG5XbTVNWVRFRFZZRGM5LU5YMUM0V2ptQnZBY3RyMzlXU3VFWlZ2YTBWS2hEUTFUZjAyaE0wa2xRR08yQQ?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"006-8","t":"印度媒體：生育與否應是女性自己的選擇","d":"印度媒體刊登評論，主張是否生育、何時生育應由女性自主決定，不應受家庭或社會強迫，強調身體自主權。","body":["印度《時報》近日刊登評論，主張生育決定權應屬於女性本人。文章認為，女性對於是否生育、生育幾個孩子擁有最終選擇權，家庭和社會不應以傳統期待施加壓力。","在印度，圍繞婚姻和生育的社會壓力仍相當普遍。許多女性在結婚後很快面臨來自親屬的生育期待，家庭計劃的實際決策往往落在丈夫或長輩手中，女性自身的意願被忽視。","將生育定義為個人選擇而非家庭義務，是對傳統性別角色的直接挑戰。這需要法律保障，也需要社會文化改變對女性身體的認知，否則選擇權仍難以真正實現。"],"why":"主流媒體直接以“女人的選擇”為標題，在生育議題上表意明確，打破常見的中性化表達。","en":{"t":"Indian Media: Having Children Should Be a Woman's Own Choice","d":"An Indian newspaper commentary argues that decisions about childbearing should belong to women, free from family or social coercion.","body":["The Times of India published a commentary asserting that women should have the final say over whether and when to have children. It argues that family expectations should not override a woman's bodily autonomy.","It acknowledges that social pressure around marriage and childbirth remains strong in India, with many women facing demands from relatives soon after marriage. Framing childbearing as an individual choice challenges traditional gender roles and calls for legal and cultural change."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"The Times of India","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"南亞"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"006-9","t":"Ilham Ahmed：一體化增強穩定但削弱女性與庫爾德權利","d":"庫爾德女性政治人物 Ilham Ahmed 認為，地區一體化雖可能帶來穩定，卻會削弱女性已取得的公共角色與庫爾德權利。","body":["Ilham Ahmed 在一次採訪中表示，地區一體化進程雖然有助於加強穩定，但也對女性已經取得的公共角色以及庫爾德權利構成壓力。她提醒，穩定不應以犧牲多元權利為代價。","在敘利亞東北部等地，女性曾在地方治理與自治中佔據相對突出的位置，參與決策和安全事務。政治整合要求統一法律與行政框架，可能改變這些既有安排，使女性代表權和族群自治空間縮小。","她的觀點揭示了穩定與權利之間的張力：在追求政治統一的過程中，少數群體和女性的既得權利容易被當作次要問題。這種提醒對任何處於轉型中的地區都有參考價值。"],"why":"她同時談論一體化、女性角色與族群權利，將性別視角嵌入地緣政治討論，較少見於主流報道。","en":{"t":"Ilham Ahmed: Integration Brings Stability but Weakens Women's Roles and Kurdish Rights","d":"Kurdish political figure Ilham Ahmed said regional integration may improve stability but risks eroding women's public roles and Kurdish rights.","body":["In an interview, Ilham Ahmed argued that integration processes can strengthen stability but also put pressure on the public roles women have achieved and on Kurdish rights. She warned that stability should not come at the expense of plural rights.","In parts of northeast Syria, women have held relatively prominent positions in local governance and security. Political integration may unify legal and administrative frameworks and thus alter those arrangements, shrinking women's representation and minority autonomy."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"ANHA","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNa29SN0ozSHNTN1FXZmtORW1maXRZcmFBQzF1bTRtdk4tVlNJelJORU5SeVNsZDlpMVJHcU41X0tRdThMZWNseS16RVp2b1g0SkNib0VrTmN0aEx0UktUTmIwZDgwOVE3aXF2M1lZVDhvVE12U1l2ajR4TkJqOXBrdmVOZUR4YnowcERObERXdDRiVVloeHNjUTd5QXpWRW5KbkpzY05OMHlBQzhVM0E?oc=5","region":"中東"}]}]},{"id":"005","date":"2026-10-09","period":"2026.10.05 – 2026.10.11","title":"女性權利的多重前線：從校園到警隊，從法庭到球場","summary":"本期聚焦全球女性議題：東京大學首位女校長、英國警員家暴停職、新西蘭醫院安全疏忽、埃及寡婦贍養權，以及體育欠薪與氣候倡導；呈現權利保護在制度、醫療、家庭和公共空間中的複雜博弈。","en":{"title":"Women's Rights on Multiple Frontlines: From Campus to Police Force, Courtroom to Pitch","summary":"This edition covers women's issues worldwide: first female president of the University of Tokyo, UK police suspensions over abuse, hospital safety failure in New Zealand, widows' alimony rights in Egypt, plus sports wage gaps and climate advocacy."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"Viridiana Regino","name_en":"Viridiana Regino","role":"原住民女性權利推動者","role_en":"Indigenous women's rights advocate","region":"拉美","why":"她因在墨西哥普埃布拉州推動土著女性權利工作獲國家獎，具體參與社區法律賦權、組織支持和能力建設，讓邊緣社區女性獲得更多話語權。","why_en":"She received Mexico's National Prize for Promoting Indigenous Women's Rights for her work in Puebla, focusing on legal empowerment and community organizing.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"熱辣滾燙","book":"知曉我姓名","art":"瑪麗娜·阿布拉莫維奇"},"sections":[{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"005-1","t":"聯合國呼籲塔利班停止因著裝規範逮捕阿富汗女性","d":"聯合國敦促阿富汗塔利班當局停止以著裝違規為由逮捕女性，指出此類行動進一步限制女性公共空間與基本自由。","body":["聯合國發聲，要求阿富汗塔利班當局立即停止因所謂著裝規範違規逮捕女性。近期有報道稱，多名女性因被指穿著不符合規定而被拘押。","塔利班重新掌權後，逐步恢復對女性著裝的強制性規定，並限制其教育、就業和出行。國際社會多次譴責，但塔利班以國內法和宗教傳統為由拒絕改變。","以著裝為名實施逮捕，將性別壓迫日常化，嚴重侵犯女性基本權利。聯合國呼籲國際社會持續施壓，為阿富汗女性爭取公共空間和尊嚴。"],"why":"僅僅因為穿著不合規定就遭逮捕，性別控制變得無比具體。","en":{"t":"UN Calls on Taliban to Halt Arrests of Afghan Women for Dress Code Violations","d":"The United Nations urges Afghan Taliban authorities to stop arresting women for alleged dress code offences, warning of further erosion of women's freedoms.","body":["The UN has called for an end to arrests of women in Afghanistan over dress code violations. Reports indicate women have been detained for clothing deemed non-compliant.","Since returning to power, the Taliban has tightened restrictions on women's dress, education, and movement. The arrests are seen as part of broader efforts to push women out of public life."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png","src":"UN News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBJM1FSM2RHRDMtR000YWdST2VGZUZWbW1xNVFTQWZ1bVl2SmZaRExxcDNUZHlYTHh5WXl5NWpMTE11cm1adXlLQnNaU0Q3YzVLdWFkQlhZRQ?oc=5","region":"南亞"}]},{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"005-2","t":"英國大型警隊45名在職警員因涉家暴女性被停職","d":"一支英國主要警察部門對45名在職警員作出停職處理，他們涉嫌對婦女和女童實施暴力，引發對執法機構內部文化的審視。","body":["英國一支大型警察部門宣佈，45名在職警員因涉嫌對婦女和女童實施暴力被停職。此次大規模停職涉及多項指控，包括家庭暴力和性侵。","此前英國警方已因多起警員施暴案受到批評，內部投訴處理不透明。數據顯示，執法機構中針對女性的暴力並非孤立事件，而是與職場文化和權力濫用相關。","警員本應是保護者，卻成為施害者，嚴重損害公眾信任。事件促使公眾要求獨立監督、嚴格篩查和更有效的內部追責機制，以保障女性安全。"],"why":"45名警員同時停職，法律守護者集體涉案，極具衝擊。","en":{"t":"45 Serving UK Police Officers Suspended over Violence Against Women","d":"A major British police force has suspended 45 serving officers over allegations of violence against women and girls, triggering new scrutiny of police culture.","body":["A UK police force has suspended 45 serving officers over alleged violence against women and girls, including domestic abuse and sexual assault.","The case renews concerns about impunity and internal handling of complaints. Public trust in police protection is undermined when officers themselves are accused of abuse."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"The Independent","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNWlpLeDM4NFNoLWFjZWl2dVd2amlUbmRLTThFZ2xMWmtnY2dBanBsM2doSmkwaGluVERrWUhyN0EtcmlXenU0OFQ5YTAyQURZeVZDUE82MWNvR2x0OVpqdThyZmkzVnlLVndlYWQ2aUhTSElHa3Frd09WZUtjU2wxQ1ZFWE5RQXprbEh3Q3d2UGRPdlVRS183LVRuaFdRZnVTbVJGQUtJVmU2X3V5NF8yY2FMbjBsRDVI?oc=5","region":"歐洲"},{"id":"005-3","t":"巴切萊特警告：女性權利倒退是發展主要風險","d":"智利前總統巴切萊特在拉加經委會會議上表示，女性權利倒退是該地區發展面臨的主要風險之一，呼籲將性別平等納入核心議程。","body":["智利前總統米歇爾·巴切萊特在拉丁美洲和加勒比經濟委員會（CEPAL）會議上警告，女性權利出現倒退，是地區發展面臨的主要風險之一。","近年來拉美多國出現保守政策回潮，女性在生殖權利、政治參與和人身安全方面的保障受到侵蝕。巴切萊特長期推動性別平等，曾任聯合國人權事務高級專員。","將女性權利與發展指標聯繫起來，指出退潮不僅關乎公平，也影響經濟增長和社會穩定。她的發言意在促使各國政府重新評估政策優先次序。"],"why":"前國家元首在區域重要平臺把女性權利與發展風險直接掛鉤，罕見而有力。","en":{"t":"Bachelet Warns: Backsliding on Women's Rights Is a Major Development Risk","d":"Former Chilean president Michelle Bachelet told CEPAL that regressions in women's rights are a key risk to development in Latin America and the Caribbean.","body":["At a CEPAL meeting, former Chilean president Michelle Bachelet said the erosion of women's rights poses one of the main risks to regional development.","Recent policy shifts in several Latin American countries have restricted reproductive rights and political participation. Bachelet urged governments to place gender equality at the center of their agendas."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"CNN Chile","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"},{"id":"005-4","t":"埃及女性工會要求總理把婦女權利列為政府優先","d":"埃及女性工會向總理公開呼籲，要求將婦女權利納入政府優先事項，以解決女性在就業、法律保護等方面面臨的長期差距。","body":["埃及女性工會要求總理曼蘇里將婦女權利作為政府優先事項。工會發表聲明，呼籲採取具體措施改善女性處境。","埃及女性在就業、財產權和人身安全等方面存在法律與社會障礙，女性組織長期爭取政策傾斜。當前經濟困境加劇了女性在勞動力市場中的脆弱性。","直接向政府首腦提出訴求，顯示女性團體從街頭抗議轉向制度內的政策倡導。能否成為優先議題，取決於政府是否願意分配資源和政治意願。"],"why":"女性工會跳過部門層級，直接向總理提出婦女權利訴求。","en":{"t":"Egyptian Women's Union Urges PM to Make Women's Rights a Government Priority","d":"The Egyptian Women's Union has publicly called on the prime minister to place women's rights at the top of the government agenda.","body":["The Egyptian Women's Union issued a statement urging the prime minister to make women's rights a government priority, citing gaps in employment and legal protection.","The move reflects a shift toward institutional advocacy rather than street protest. Whether the demand translates into policy depends on political will and resource allocation."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"24saa.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"中東"},{"id":"005-5","t":"埃及律師：寡婦有權向亡夫父兄追討贍養費","d":"阿拉伯律師協會婦女委員會成員表示，寡婦可對已故丈夫的父親和兄弟提起贍養訴訟，為喪偶女性獲得經濟支持提供法律依據。","body":["阿拉伯律師協會婦女委員會一名成員表示，根據相關法律解釋，寡婦有權對已故丈夫的父親和兄弟提起贍養費訴訟。該觀點旨在澄清女性在丈夫去世後的經濟權利。","在埃及等國的家庭法中，夫家親屬有時對喪偶女性負有照顧義務，但實踐中常被忽視或推諉。許多寡婦在失去主要經濟來源後陷入貧困。","這一法律解釋為寡婦提供了新的救濟途徑，也挑戰了傳統上女性依附夫家、無權主動求償的規範。但實際執行中能否落實，仍取決於司法實踐和社會壓力。"],"why":"贍養義務被擴展到夫家親屬，突破了以往只向丈夫本人求償的侷限。","en":{"t":"Egyptian Lawyer Says Widows Can Sue Deceased Husband's Father and Brother for Alimony","d":"A member of the Arab Lawyers Union's women's committee says widows have the right to file alimony claims against a deceased husband's father and brother.","body":["A legal expert stated that widows in Egypt may seek alimony from their deceased husband's father and brother, clarifying an often-overlooked obligation.","Such claims could provide economic security for widows who lose their main source of income. Enforcement, however, will depend on courts and social attitudes."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"المصري اليوم","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9sVGxvWGRJcnAxSDVxdGtlV0g3cjNxbUlEaTFlZzd4VGlkVEV2RHNJbW8yZktBUHhhSXVUaWQ4MVRtMHlWUFk1VnFtRG8yZXpOY1p1SHBSRWJKTzVPVXBZ?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"005-6","t":"新西蘭醫院無視女性安全警告，讓患者與危險友人獨處","d":"一名女性曾告知醫院工作人員她對朋友感到不安全，院方仍安排兩人獨處，事件暴露醫療系統對親密關係暴力風險響應不足。","body":["新西蘭一名女性在醫院看病時，明確告訴工作人員她對陪同朋友感到不安全，但院方依然讓她與對方單獨相處。該事件經媒體曝光後引發關注。","醫療場所往往缺乏對親密關係暴力的系統篩查，醫護人員很少接受識別和響應風險的培訓。女性在就醫時若處於被控制關係中，醫院可能成為危險環境。","這一案例表明，女性主動發出求助信號，專業機構卻未重視。醫療系統需要建立安全評估和轉介機制，確保尋求健康服務不附帶傷害風險。"],"why":"女性已經開口說害怕，仍被安排和對方獨處，風險被輕率處理。","en":{"t":"NZ Hospital Left Patient Alone with Friend She Deemed Unsafe, Despite Warning","d":"A woman told hospital staff she felt unsafe with a friend, but they left her alone with him, highlighting gaps in healthcare responses to violence risk.","body":["A woman in New Zealand warned hospital staff that she felt unsafe with a friend, but they still left her alone with him. The incident was reported by media.","Healthcare settings often lack systematic screening for intimate partner violence, leaving vulnerable patients exposed. The case calls for better staff training and safety protocols."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"NZ Herald","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNeHhIMFYxZk90WHA5X2pjbjNxVWxta29zWnNIUHhIY3FSQ0s2aWk1V0l0V3MxeGVPbDhZZU5yYV9jVUY4R2JzSUc4WFNMLUUya0VyRUJkWElmWlRjSzVNMnZuOVBJN0s0TEl3dTNBVWJGb29UdVVMcmJ4c2NLWGxPVG1SdjFQYnJDUGxZaUwwTEFEVV95WEpxNnB4dmlGQXlGMGJuYlc1SDZLOGtpcmF2bVUxQlpHTWY3cHgtN2p0RjVucTcyeEk0?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"},{"id":"005-7","t":"坦桑尼亞議員敦促立法保護婦女兒童健康權","d":"坦桑尼亞議員圖利婭博士推動制定法律，以保障婦女、兒童和青年的健康權利，回應醫療資源不足與法律保障薄弱的問題。","body":["坦桑尼亞議員圖利婭博士呼籲通過立法，保護婦女、兒童和青年的健康權利。她在公共場合表示，現有法律不足以應對醫療可及性和質量問題。","非洲多國在孕產婦保健、兒童營養和青年生殖健康方面指標落後，部分地區因資金短缺和設施不足導致可預防死亡。法律框架的缺失使問責困難。","議員主導的立法倡議可能將健康權從政策宣示提升為可訴權利。若通過，將為弱勢群體提供法律工具，推動政府履行健康投入義務。"],"why":"由本土女性議員推動健康立法，而非等待外援或外部壓力。","en":{"t":"Tanzanian MP Pushes for Laws to Protect Health Rights of Women and Children","d":"Tanzanian MP Dr Tulia is advocating for legislation to safeguard health rights for women, children, and youth, amid persistent gaps in healthcare access.","body":["Dr Tulia, a Tanzanian member of parliament, has called for new laws to protect the health rights of women, children, and young people.","She argues that current legal protections are inadequate, and that binding legislation would hold the government accountable for delivering equitable healthcare."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"Daily News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOTDkxUFlhdjJ0bzBTYk5YTUV3MkdQTzZSakliMHE3VVkwY3N4akZqc2Z6Y2Y1VGNHQlJTclQ0SEVKZ1R2Yk4zZE9iU3c4XzVGOEZzMXU5cHV6OXpyTjRjMXJzaXdjUkxXaHdZX19pOVFzU0J0SF9DZ2VaS2wyZEg5TEE0ckxYbDJCZEd2U2F4XzFlY2p0dVYzMy1Oenprb1VpRmlOQw?oc=5","region":"非洲"}]},{"cat":"體育","en_cat":"Sports","items":[{"id":"005-8","t":"科林蒂安結清女球員形象權欠款，獎金仍拖欠","d":"巴西科林蒂安俱樂部支付了女足球員的形象權欠款，但賽事獎金尚未結清，凸顯女足領域普遍的資金拖欠與投入差距。","body":["巴西科林蒂安俱樂部宣佈已結清其女足隊員的形象權欠款，但確認賽事獎金仍未支付。球員們此前通過法律或集體談判追討欠款。","女子足球在巴西乃至全球長期面臨資金不足，贊助和獎金遠低於男子項目。即使像科林蒂安這樣擁有女足強隊的俱樂部，也出現拖欠現象。","形象權欠款清除雖是一步進展，但獎金未結清意味著薪酬保障仍不完整。女足球員需要更透明的財務管理和合同執行，才能真正實現職業化。"],"why":"豪門俱樂部也拖欠女球員報酬，說明欠薪不是個案而是行業常態。","en":{"t":"Corinthians Pays Women's Image Rights Arrears, Prize Money Still Unpaid","d":"Brazil's Corinthians has cleared image-rights arrears for its women's footballers, but prize payments remain outstanding, reflecting persistent wage gaps in the women's game.","body":["Corinthians confirmed it has paid outstanding image-rights dues to female players, though tournament prize money is still owed.","The case highlights chronic underfunding in women's football, where even top clubs struggle to guarantee timely payment. Financial transparency and contract enforcement remain critical."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"OneFootball","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNZmdXaWlWRVNDNHl3WnY3czNkTG9xb18xaGhqSWFRV1lndHZlc0FLQmV4SXdSRW5CTzU0MEo5ckNWY1JrLXQ4T2VIdEtTaHhQR1RMYUVmMkRHSm5VZzVXcFNlTGlwMGstSzhwN0lrVTdIZHkzU1MwUmxRRElkQUdPX1V4dEV1ZVBaNy1rOHJPRmg4cklUcTh2NDNtekN2YUlmNG4zM2hLNVcyZjBFUHRXbXdET3diakpNRDFMLTFldUI?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"005-9","t":"東京大學首位女校長折射日本性別平等現狀","d":"聯合早報刊發柴思原文章，從東京大學建校以來首位女性校長任命切入，討論日本高等教育與社會的性別平等進展與深層阻力。","body":["日本最高學府東京大學近日產生首位女校長。作者柴思原撰文指出，這一任命打破了該校長期由男性主導的最高領導層慣例，成為觀察日本性別平等現狀的一個窗口。","日本在全球性別差距指數中排名長期靠後，大學管理層與教授席位中的女性佔比遠低於國際水平。女性學者往往因家庭責任、評審偏見和缺乏導師網絡而難以晉升至頂層。","首位女校長具有象徵意義，但單一任命並不自動改變結構。評論認為，需要檢視招聘、晉升和學術文化中隱性的性別篩選機制，否則個別突破可能掩蓋系統性的不平等延續。"],"why":"日本最保守的學術權力中心首次由女性執掌，反差鮮明。","en":{"t":"University of Tokyo's First Female President Reflects Japan's Gender Equality Reality","d":"Columnist Chai Siyuan uses the first female president of the University of Tokyo to examine progress and persistent obstacles for gender equality in Japanese higher education.","body":["Japan's University of Tokyo has appointed its first female president. The author notes that this breaks a long tradition of male leadership at the country's top academic institution.","Yet Japan ranks low on global gender gap indexes, and women remain rare in senior academic roles. The appointment is symbolic, but structural barriers in promotion and workplace culture still need to be addressed."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"聯合早報","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE9ZcjJqY0dCTmN2RmJlaVRHSGp4RmVibWl2ZTRISWpZa0hiVVFneTRMQjFuY0l2S3BZcHhqalJNVTM1YTFJemNGOXZmQ0RyN1RUQnlfRmJSaGVQbTBPYXNhTjJIblR0NFE5OE9J?oc=5","region":"東亞"},{"id":"005-10","t":"國際女孩日：從加沙到圖瓦盧，女孩在行動","d":"在國際女孩日報道中，來自加沙、圖瓦盧等地的女孩通過教育、社區組織等方式推動變革，展現女童作為行動者的力量。","body":["在國際女孩日當天，Women's Agenda 報道了來自加沙、圖瓦盧等不同地區的女孩，她們通過教育和社區活動改善自身處境。","全球範圍內，女童在武裝衝突、氣候變化和貧困中承受更高風險，受教育機會和人身安全常被剝奪。但許多女孩選擇組織起來、表達訴求。","從受害者到行動者的敘事轉變，提醒政策制定者應傾聽女童的聲音。支持女孩的領導力，需要資金、安全空間和教育機會的實質性投入。"],"why":"報道沒有停留在苦難展示，而是聚焦女孩改變現狀的具體行動。","en":{"t":"International Day of the Girl: Girls from Gaza to Tuvalu Taking Action","d":"On International Day of the Girl, stories highlight girls in Gaza, Tuvalu and beyond who are driving change through education and community organizing.","body":["Women's Agenda marked International Day of the Girl by featuring girls from conflict zones and climate-vulnerable islands who are leading local initiatives.","These stories shift the narrative from victimhood to agency. Supporting girls' leadership requires investment in education, safe spaces, and real participation."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"Women's Agenda","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNSmJSdVdvOGg4Q0t4OVliYVNxTFdZaFdrSkRPclU1cUpURm5VdFpqSWxrS0pONmNQTVZpLTM5Nklkc1hmWm5ic1F6N1AweHg3MExvTVcyMGdVNHdjSUQtMVUxTXFGR2piMmE2VGY2MnA0ZTNGSUZYcmRfZk91dUdCQmxrTFVtZmR2cVhrZ2ZXckZkb0VnRElYWXk2TzV3NWc4REhVNktiNVNqamdvQWR4T0RscXYwUW5jc1ViQ1BXME1sUQ?oc=5","region":"全球"}]}]},{"id":"004","date":"2026-10-02","period":"2026.09.28 – 2026.10.04","title":"Wake Up Girls 全球女性議題週報：法律、身體與政治參與","summary":"本期聚焦日本首例性騷擾訴訟、韓國職場晉升歧視、伊朗鞭刑、尼日利亞繼承權與印度性暴力等議題，橫跨亞非拉美歐澳，呈現女性在法律、職場、身體自主與公共參與中的處境。","en":{"title":"Global Women's Issues Weekly: Law, Bodies, and Political Participation","summary":"This issue covers Japan's first sexual harassment lawsuit, workplace discrimination in South Korea, flogging in Iran, inheritance denial in Nigeria, and sexual violence in India, spanning Asia, Africa, the Americas, Europe and Oceania."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"迪亞米拉·裡貝羅","name_en":"Djamila Ribeiro","role":"哲學家 / 作家 / 行動者","role_en":"Philosopher / Writer / Activist","region":"拉美","why":"她在巴西主流媒體撰文追問“何時輪到女性”，長期以黑人女性主義視角剖析種族與性別交叉的不平等，推動公共教育和政策討論。","why_en":"A leading Black feminist intellectual in Brazil, she uses public writing to challenge structural racism and sexism.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQVWliSG9TeUhwN283cVo5clJuX0ZyeTBwb3pCbHpLYjNYakxUYzZFa2pPVmJPN3c2c2pBVkRIVUoybHFia0ZlVENLNjZYd1hOUHBkbGd6NThxQTRxTXlwNjlSZWRuOWNpSmJHM3pzdXR0d2F6MmhtcF9Fa21meHB2VHdFTEJLakFZaFVxX0xkS2kzV2wwaklyTkJlMTMzWFE?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"好東西","book":"一間自己的房間","art":"小野洋子"},"sections":[{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"004-1","t":"日本首起性騷擾訴訟女律師：女性歧視現實未變","d":"日本首起性騷擾訴訟的代理女律師回顧案件，指出職場性騷擾與性別歧視如今依然普遍，法律改革勢在必行。","body":["日本首起性騷擾訴訟的女性代理律師近日接受採訪，講述了當年推動這一前例性案件的經過。她表示，發起訴訟不僅為當事人爭取正義，更希望喚醒社會對職場性騷擾問題的關注。該案在當時幾乎沒有先例可循，面臨很大風險。","該案發生在日本經濟高速增長後，女性大量進入職場卻面臨不平等待遇的時期。性騷擾概念當時尚未被日本法律普遍承認，多數受害者選擇沉默，企業也缺乏預防和處理機制。律師團隊需要克服法律和輿論的重重阻力。","律師指出，儘管如今性騷擾防治已被寫入法律，但女性在職場中仍面臨隱性歧視與報復。此案的意義在於確立了司法先例，但真正的性別平等仍需制度與文化的持續改變，不能止步於個別勝訴。"],"why":"日本首例性騷擾訴訟，意味著法律首次承認職場中女性身體尊嚴受損可訴。","en":{"t":"Japan's First Sexual Harassment Lawsuit Lawyer: Discrimination Reality Unchanged","d":"The lawyer behind Japan's first sexual harassment lawsuit reflects on the case, noting workplace harassment and gender discrimination remain widespread.","body":["The woman lawyer who led Japan's first sexual harassment lawsuit spoke about the case, which established a legal precedent for workplace harassment claims in the country.","Despite legal reforms, she says discrimination persists, and women still face retaliation and silence when reporting abuse."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"現代ビジネス","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1WaEV6VWxUc2prUGwtWEpsUVNSSkpiYTB3VzhkTmVfV0F5bTcxNmx3SThrQlo1eWV5QmV1Xy1sbmQxQmtYOW1DcTNnRG9mVjQ?oc=5","region":"東亞"},{"id":"004-2","t":"尼日利亞女性繼承權仍遭剝奪，律師指加劇貧困與暴力","d":"尼日利亞獨立66年後，許多地區仍依習俗剝奪女性繼承權，律師稱這加劇女性貧困和家庭暴力，亟待改革。","body":["尼日利亞女性律師埃澤洛指出，該國獨立66年來，眾多社區仍依據傳統習俗否認女性的土地和財產繼承權，使女性在喪偶或離婚後失去經濟來源。她呼籲政府優先處理這一長期被忽視的問題。","儘管尼日利亞憲法禁止性別歧視，但繼承事務多由習慣法和宗教法主導，女性難以通過司法途徑獲得救濟。經濟弱勢導致女性更易陷入貧困並遭受家庭暴力，甚至被迫接受不公正的安排。這一狀況在農村地區尤為嚴重。","這一議題將繼承權與女性安全直接聯結。活動人士呼籲政府通過立法和司法改革消除歧視性習俗，否則性別平等的承諾難以落實。財產權保障是女性獨立與免於暴力的基礎。"],"why":"尼日利亞獨立66年仍未保障女性繼承權，法律與習俗之間差距巨大。","en":{"t":"Nigeria Still Denies Women Inheritance Rights, Lawyer Says, Fueling Poverty and Violence","d":"A Nigerian lawyer says many communities still deny women inheritance rights 66 years after independence, worsening female poverty and domestic violence.","body":["Lawyer Ezeilo highlights that customary and religious laws often override constitutional protections, leaving women without land or property after a spouse's death.","Without economic security, women face higher risks of poverty and abuse. Activists urge the government to prioritize legal reform on inheritance."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Sahara Reporters","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPXzhzV2hQLUhoaG1NMER4ZXFGTVZ0YUQzN0pKS21WYS0zOEZ1SUNDT1l2Y1lBUHExUU1ycGkxaHhlM1I2THh0TmtLbmYwOEZmTjl0Ty1xSmVaOXBMMm4ycTBPcXQyUlVqVlpreTJnRTdrM1lsalFEektBTlFpMDBRZ3BqR1lHdVpGTW1mQWdOeXNPa091cGFJMTJ3S1VyOEVvT3o0VzVzWjJkdzNDUkhRSTJGLW9JM0hpemhzeVpZemFTd1ZKTUE?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"004-3","t":"美國教育部推翻拜登時期第九條規則，恢復女性保護","d":"美國教育部宣佈撤銷拜登政府時期的第九條民權規則，稱將恢復對女性及女孩的保護，引發不同解讀。","body":["美國教育部宣佈廢除拜登政府時期的第九條規則，該規則曾擴展對跨性別學生的保護。教育部稱，新措施將恢復對女性和女孩的權益保護，避免性別概念被擴大解釋，從而影響女性專屬空間。","第九條是美國禁止教育領域性別歧視的聯邦法律。近年來，圍繞跨性別學生使用設施和參與體育的爭議不斷，不同政府上臺後政策反覆，學校和學區在執行上面臨混亂。各州之間的差異也日益擴大。","此舉被保守派視為恢復傳統性別秩序，但民權組織擔憂會削弱對跨性別學生的保護。政策搖擺凸顯美國性別政治的高度對立，以及法律解釋對弱勢群體的直接影響。"],"why":"同一部法律在不同政府下被賦予完全相反的性別定義。","en":{"t":"US Education Department Reverses Biden-Era Title IX Rule, Says Restores Protections for Women","d":"The US Education Department revoked the Biden administration's Title IX rule, saying it restores protections for women and girls.","body":["The reversal changes how schools interpret sex discrimination, particularly regarding transgender students' access to facilities and sports.","Supporters call it a return to fairness, while critics say it endangers transgender students and deepens political polarization."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Campus Reform","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQT29jclBnR2RVTUxldWpYam1zZlFJbnllc1FDQlNNRkhfbXhPbl9WdUJHWWR6SG43MkphZ080UE9mbk9UWUhCbmRXdnBCTE9xRFBBTUR1OXJxUS1UajU1dFAyLWsxbmNxLU1PeVlJNERxT0pfQWU2QUxFRE9IemZIVkgzZjVRd2JHZ1F4T3NnQVp4NHFldGlYSWlMOF8zNzMwNG5ySGJTNkxkRkFOUnhFMGh4LXFqWVYwbkt4OWtLUWpZTDhHRTdXbQ?oc=5","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"004-4","t":"韓國人權委認定兵役加分造成女性晉升歧視","d":"韓國國家人權委員會裁定，將軍隊服役經歷作為晉升優勢的做法對女性構成間接歧視，要求相關部門加以改善。","body":["韓國國家人權委員會近日表示，將男性兵役經歷自動等同於工作經歷並給予晉升優待，構成對女性的間接歧視。該委員會要求相關機構修改規定，消除性別差異影響，保障女性在職場中獲得平等的晉升機會。","在韓國，所有男性需服兵役，女性通常不服役。長期以來，很多企業將服役年限計入工齡或作為晉升評定時加分，認為這是對男性服役的補償。然而，這一做法使女性在職業發展中處於系統性的不利位置。","這一裁定引發對職場性別平等的討論。支持者認為必須消除系統性偏差，反對者則認為服役是男性承擔的特殊義務。如何平衡服役補償與性別平等仍存爭議，相關機構的後續措施將受到密切關注。"],"why":"韓國以兵役為名給予男性晉升優待，實質將女性排除在同等職業發展之外。","en":{"t":"South Korea Rights Body Says Military Service Bonus Discriminates Against Women in Promotions","d":"South Korea's human rights commission ruled that granting promotion advantages based on military service constitutes indirect discrimination against women.","body":["The commission found that counting military service as work experience or promotion credits disadvantages women, who are generally exempt from conscription. It urged institutions to revise related rules.","Supporters see the ruling as a step toward removing systemic bias, while critics argue it overlooks men's compulsory service obligations."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png","src":"한국NGO신문","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFAzWnNUWTFQbm1ieG1RZmhtSW5SeU44MzNISUVqQ0I3YnlNWjN2T3NjelNlTGQxUjVfbG5MSldzekJyZ1JvUGowZDhLb3F2UDVnWUZKQnNGSDZrRmlWdlhYLVZlc1czcVNI?oc=5","region":"東亞"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"004-5","t":"國際特赦組織：伊朗鞭刑侵犯女性權利等同酷刑","d":"國際特赦組織指出，伊朗對女性施以鞭刑的做法違反國際人權法，構成酷刑或殘忍待遇，應被禁止。","body":["國際特赦組織發表聲明，譴責伊朗法院對女性判處鞭刑。該組織認為，此類刑罰專門針對女性的行為進行懲罰，嚴重侵犯其身體完整權與人格尊嚴，構成國際法所禁止的酷刑或殘忍待遇，必須立即停止。","伊朗法律受伊斯蘭刑法影響，對某些行為處以鞭刑，女性常因著裝、社交或道德指控受罰。國際人權機構多次呼籲停止體罰，但伊朗當局仍維持相關判罰，甚至公開執行以儆效尤。","將鞭刑與酷刑相提並論，凸顯了性別化的暴力如何以法律形式被制度化。該問題不僅關乎伊朗，也提醒國際社會關注身體自主權與司法懲罰的邊界，以及法律對女性身體的控制。"],"why":"國際特赦組織將伊朗鞭刑定性為酷刑，罕見地聚焦性別化體罰。","en":{"t":"Amnesty International: Iran's Flogging Violates Women's Rights, Amounts to Torture","d":"Amnesty International says flogging sentences against women in Iran violate international human rights law and constitute torture.","body":["The rights group condemned Iranian courts for sentencing women to flogging, often for moral or dress-related charges.","Such punishments institutionalize gender-based violence and highlight the need to defend bodily autonomy worldwide."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"رؤيا الإخباري","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTE43TGxWbDJsYXlDZ1BRSWpyTkZPaTdYNUdtb1lNYy01QUlCZTNWQ3RfSkQ3VG9DcExuLXowdmYzbzBqVjFqVHc?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"004-6","t":"印度性暴力事件頻發，女性安全感持續下降","d":"德國之聲報道，印度多地性暴力案件高發，女性對公共安全和司法救濟的信心低落，生存處境令人擔憂。","body":["德國之聲報道指出，印度持續發生的性暴力案件讓許多女性不再感到安全。從城市街頭到鄉村，性騷擾和性侵事件頻發，部分案件引發大規模抗議。女性在公共場所和交通工具上常常面臨騷擾風險。","儘管印度在2012年巴士輪姦案後加強了性犯罪法律，但執行不力、警察態度消極和審判拖延等問題依然突出。社會對受害者的汙名化也令許多人不敢報案，導致實際案件數量遠高於官方統計。","女性安全感的下降不僅影響個人生活，也限制其教育、就業和公共參與。該報道呼籲關注制度性失效與文化偏見，而不僅是孤立案件。安全環境的缺失正在侵蝕社會整體的性別平等進程。"],"why":"法律改革後性暴力仍高發，說明立法進步未自動轉化為安全保障。","en":{"t":"Sexual Violence in India: Why Women No Longer Feel Safe","d":"DW reports that rising sexual violence in India has eroded women's sense of safety, with weak enforcement and stigma compounding the problem.","body":["Despite stricter laws after the 2012 Delhi gang rape, police inaction, delayed trials, and victim-blaming persist.","Fear of violence restricts women's mobility and participation in education and work, deepening gender inequality."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"DW.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"南亞"},{"id":"004-7","t":"迪亞米拉·裡貝羅撰文：何時輪到女性？","d":"巴西哲學家迪亞米拉·裡貝羅在專欄中追問女性在政治與社會中的位置，指出性別不平等仍被長期忽視。","body":["巴西作家、哲學家迪亞米拉·裡貝羅在《聖保羅頁報》發表評論，以“何時輪到女性？”為題，討論女性在巴西政治與社會決策中的邊緣化處境。她指出，性別議題常被置於議程末端，男性主導的權力結構長期未有實質改變。","裡貝羅長期以黑人女性主義視角分析巴西的種族與性別問題，其著作和演講推動公眾正視結構性歧視。她指出，女性尤其黑人女性在權力結構中仍然代表性不足，機會與資源分配存在明顯失衡。","這篇專欄不只是情緒宣洩，而是提出女性必須關注政治參與和制度變革。其觀點在巴西及拉美地區引發廣泛共鳴，促使人們重新審視性別平等的優先次序，以及誰有權定義公共議題。"],"why":"裡貝羅作為黑人女性知識分子，在主流報紙直接質疑女性的政治缺席。","en":{"t":"Djamila Ribeiro Asks: When Will It Be Women's Turn?","d":"Brazilian philosopher Djamila Ribeiro writes in a column that women remain marginalized in politics and decision-making.","body":["Ribeiro, a leading Black feminist voice in Brazil, argues that structural inequality keeps women, especially Black women, underrepresented in power.","Her piece calls for renewed attention to women's political participation across Latin America."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"Folha de S.Paulo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQVWliSG9TeUhwN283cVo5clJuX0ZyeTBwb3pCbHpLYjNYakxUYzZFa2pPVmJPN3c2c2pBVkRIVUoybHFia0ZlVENLNjZYd1hOUHBkbGd6NThxQTRxTXlwNjlSZWRuOWNpSmJHM3pzdXR0d2F6MmhtcF9Fa21meHB2VHdFTEJLakFZaFVxX0xkS2kzV2wwaklyTkJlMTMzWFE?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"004-8","t":"墨西哥莫雷納黨將在保守州推動女性墮胎權立法","d":"墨西哥執政黨計劃在保守派主導的州遊說，確保女性擁有自主決定生育的權利，相關立法進程備受關注。","body":["墨西哥執政黨莫雷納的議員瓜達盧佩·查維拉表示，將在保守派主導的州推動立法，保障女性決定自己身體的權利。她認為生育自主不應因地域而受限，所有女性都應平等獲得生殖健康服務。","墨西哥近年來在墮胎權方面取得進展，但部分保守州仍維持嚴格限制。聯邦與地方之間的法律差異導致女性獲得服務的機會不平等，許多女性被迫前往其他地區或尋求不安全途徑。","推動地方立法是擴大女性生殖權利的重要步驟，也面臨宗教團體和保守政治勢力的反對。這一博弈反映了拉美地區生育自主權鬥爭的典型張力，對其他國家也具有參照意義。"],"why":"執政黨主動在反對聲較大的州推動墮胎權，打破通常的迴避態度。","en":{"t":"Mexico's Morena Party to Push Abortion Rights in Conservative States","d":"Lawmakers from Mexico's ruling Morena party plan to lobby conservative states to guarantee women's right to decide over their bodies.","body":["Senator Guadalupe Chavira says reproductive autonomy should not depend on geography. Mexico has advanced abortion rights federally, but some states still restrict access.","The push faces opposition from conservative and religious groups, highlighting regional divides over bodily autonomy in Latin America."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"senado.gob","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"004-9","t":"瑞典人權獎表彰AI研究者與女性權利活動家","d":"瑞典一項人權獎項頒發給人工智能研究者與女性權利活動人士，肯定其推動科技公平與性別平等的貢獻。","body":["瑞典一知名人權獎項近日公佈獲獎者，表彰在人工智能研究和女性權利領域作出貢獻的人士。獎項旨在鼓勵利用科技和行動推動社會公正，特別是在性別平等和數字權利交叉的議題上。","獲獎者中包括關注算法偏見與公平的AI研究者，以及長期從事女性權利倡導的基層活動家。獎項跨越不同地區，強調人權議題的全球關聯性，以及技術在保護或侵害權利中的雙重作用。","將科技研究者與女性活動家並列表彰，顯示性別平等與數字權利正在成為國際人權議程的重要交叉點。這也啟發更多創新者將倫理與平等納入技術實踐，避免技術進步加劇既有不平等。"],"why":"獎項將AI研究者與女性活動家並列，體現性別與科技的議題交叉。","en":{"t":"Swedish Rights Prize Honours AI Researcher and Women's Rights Campaigners","d":"A Swedish human rights prize has recognised an AI researcher and women's rights advocates for their work on technology fairness and gender equality.","body":["The award highlights the intersection of digital rights and gender justice, honouring those who tackle algorithmic bias and grassroots activism.","International recognition helps amplify work on issues that affect women's access to opportunities worldwide."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png","src":"ECR","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOOF9FVzNxRGdWTk9GNWRXZTUtXzdCNEZXUlg2UGcwOUltMzlldnZhNmJ3RHFHdjFDSGx6RUNaa2x2eGFlNm9GZUhYajNmZDY5dGVzcV9jSlI5QTlxSWhlYkZ2bnZzb2dwTWN0dkp1b3R5emM3eEttU1VnRjJ3dUp4RA?oc=5","region":"歐洲"}]},{"cat":"文化","en_cat":"Culture","items":[{"id":"004-10","t":"希臘裔澳大利亞女性先鋒入選維多利亞州女性榮譽榜","d":"多位希臘裔澳大利亞女性入選維多利亞州女性榮譽榜，表彰她們在社區、文化或專業領域的開創性貢獻。","body":["澳大利亞維多利亞州公佈年度女性榮譽榜，多位希臘裔澳大利亞女性入選。該榜旨在表彰為社區和多元文化社會作出突出貢獻的女性，肯定她們在文化傳承、公共服務等領域的長期付出。","入選者來自不同領域，包括社區服務、文化傳承和專業工作。榮譽榜是維多利亞州認可女性成就的長期項目，強調移民背景女性的獨特貢獻，以及她們在融合社會中的橋梁作用。","將少數族裔女性納入主流榮譽體系，不僅是對個人努力的肯定，也有助於提升多元文化社會中女性榜樣的可見度，激勵更多年輕移民女性參與公共事務，改變對女性角色的傳統期待。"],"why":"移民背景女性往往在主流榮譽體系中容易被忽略。","en":{"t":"Greek Australian Trailblazers Join Victorian Honour Roll of Women","d":"Several Greek Australian women have been inducted into the Victorian Honour Roll of Women for their contributions to community and multicultural society.","body":["The Honour Roll recognises women across fields, highlighting the role of immigrant women in shaping Victoria's social fabric.","Inclusion boosts visibility for minority women and encourages broader participation in public life."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"The Greek Herald","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNX0ZfR01TMWhrNFhvZzBzSXZ2b3QzcGFUWTVVMDFEV3dNQjkzQnB5OWxEbDdJWE44SzdudTR3WlR0eUl0eU5CcXdhZlFhcV80X3hxMElfRGF1Zm1NREswX01UZFF4Y3B3NTZZLUZwdVo0UEhCSFdiQzFwU1hvMHdodG16TU1Rbi1Cal9PREFPMUgzYXE1cTQ1ZlVrYXgxQlBtMXltQkN3?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"}]}]},{"id":"003","date":"2026-09-25","period":"2026.09.21 – 2026.09.27","title":"全球女性權益週報：從天皇繼承到土地所有權，平等仍是進行時","summary":"本期聚焦日本皇位繼承性別壁壘、尼泊爾女性土地權利、厄瓜多爾殺害女性、加納憲法改革爭議、聯合國性別平等報告等12條新聞，覆蓋東亞、南亞、拉美、非洲、北美、歐洲、中東、全球與東南亞，呈現政策進步與制度慣性並存的複雜圖景。","en":{"title":"Global Women's Rights Weekly: From Imperial Succession to Land Rights, Equality Is Still in Progress","summary":"This edition covers Japan's imperial gender gap, Nepali women's land rights, femicide in Ecuador, Ghana's constitutional reform dispute, and a UN gender equality report, among 12 stories across East Asia, South Asia, Latin America, Africa, North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","watch":{"name":"Nágila Brito","name_en":"Nágila Brito","role":"女性權利倡導者","role_en":"Women's rights advocate","region":"巴西","why":"因在維護婦女權益領域的長期行動獲得“不朽者”稱號，代表巴西基層女性權利倡導力量。她的工作讓地方層面的援助與抗爭被看到，是社區正義的具體推動者。","why_en":"Honored with the title of “Immortal” for her long-standing work defending women's rights in Brazil, she represents grassroots advocacy that brings local struggles into view.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOLVlzc3YtemxicUVRR3BpZ3N6bl9lc0hDZ2ZHVGtCWmJOVXZnUDdPRTdaTkNIQzhQRjhSeF85V2dOd2VFbV9wWHd1anpCM3FRTzRnY1owMm1HTEhUZU9wQnZSRkNTTFNQbzFLNktZNU01NDJRNEdqOTJxR2pfQ0ZSRnRZNExuVHdFbU9ZbzJGd2wwcFRTbkJVcGdJT3YtX01LMjBIUkdvNFdYUnV5UXB4SWJJQXpVTWlNQ0E?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"墜落的審判","book":"厭女","art":"弗裡達·卡羅"},"sections":[{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"003-1","t":"聯合國報告：全球性別平等嚴重偏離軌道","d":"聯合國最新報告顯示全球性別平等進展嚴重滯後，若按當前速度，實現性別平等目標遙遙無期，需採取更有力行動。","body":["聯合國發佈報告指出，全球性別平等進程嚴重偏離軌道，現有努力不足以按時實現可持續發展目標中的性別平等。報告措辭直接，罕見地使用“嚴重偏離軌道”來描述現狀，透露出國際社會對進展緩慢的擔憂。","報告提到多項目標進展緩慢，受疫情、衝突和經濟下行影響，女性在就業、教育、安全等領域差距回潮。此前有報道稱按現有速度，實現性別平等可能要等到2197年，遠晚於2030年的承諾。","國際社會的承諾與投入之間存在巨大差距。若性別平等被持續推遲，社會整體發展潛力也將受損。報告提醒，危機往往首先壓縮女性在教育、就業和安全上的資源，而不僅僅是統計數字的回落。"],"why":"報告用了“嚴重偏離軌道”這樣少見的措辭，說明國際目標的實際進展比想像中更差。","en":{"t":"UN report says gender equality is woefully off track","d":"A new UN report finds global progress toward gender equality is far behind schedule.","body":["The UN reports that gender equality is woefully off track, with multiple targets lagging. Crises have worsened women's situations in employment, education, and safety.","Without accelerated action, equality remains a distant goal. The report calls for stronger commitment and notes that current efforts are insufficient for the 2030 agenda."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png","src":"news.un.org","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9CRWFIZzY1S1RaczVwZnF5d3g2Y2NzN0dEcXZ0VXAzRjNPVTFfc3JIVkhlSXVYdUhJcVhNRkp0SldLbExydXNQS1JMWXJxYl9XT3FKOV91MA?oc=5","region":"全球"}]},{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"003-2","t":"女性可當首相卻難承天皇位：日本皇位繼承的性別壁壘","d":"日本評論家島田裕巳指出，即便女性可任首相，現行皇室典範仍將愛子公主排除在天皇繼承序列之外。圍繞女性天皇的討論被政治因素長期擱置，折射法律與習俗的性別歧視。","body":["日本政壇已有女性出任首相的現實，但皇室繼承仍受限於只允許男性天皇的《皇室典範》。評論家島田裕巳指出，愛子公主被排除在繼承序列之外，這種反差暴露出制度深處的不平等。","日本《皇室典範》規定皇位由男性皇族繼承，女性婚後需脫離皇籍。近年來皇族人數減少，民眾對女性天皇接受度較高，但保守政治力量仍以傳統為由拒絕修法，將問題長期擱置。","將女性排除在最高象徵職位之外，顯示法律性別平等的侷限。即使女性可擔任行政首腦，象徵性權力仍保留給男性，反映制度慣性對性別進步的制約。"],"why":"女性已能出任首相，但愛子仍被排除在天皇繼承序列之外，這種反差很少被放在一起比較。","en":{"t":"Women can be prime minister but Princess Aiko cannot be emperor: Japan's imperial gender gap","d":"A commentator highlights the contradiction between women reaching political leadership and the male-only imperial succession law.","body":["Japan has seen women assume the prime ministership, yet Princess Aiko remains excluded from the imperial line under current law. The male-only succession rule persists, setting the symbolic head of state apart from political progress.","The debate over female emperors faces resistance from conservative forces, even as public support is high. The gap reveals how legal inequality can survive in symbolic institutions."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Yahoo!ニュース","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPaWszblEwTmxBbDV2VThjMmhrVHJRNVFSWUJha3lCaHRMbUxjeExfdWU3SW1TWWVoaG4wdTFQeGxPcjJQd3ZIZzRHWjd2d2ZZU1VKRTBoM0xWQW85azJNTXFKY244NjNCdTV2TnNkQ3Y2cFRHZDRJeWNhVlAzOG96WTljdUlrNWJN?oc=5","region":"東亞"},{"id":"003-3","t":"加納婦女團體拒絕憲法審查中的性別平等改革方案","d":"加納婦女團體對憲法審查中涉及性別平等的改革條款表達拒絕，認為現有方案未能回應女性實際訴求，甚至可能弱化已有保障。","body":["加納進行憲法審查期間，婦女團體公開反對某些性別平等改革建議，擔心條文表述損害女性權益。她們認為改革方向與女性實際需求相悖，因此選擇拒絕而非默認接受。","加納憲法已確認性別平等原則，但習慣法在婚姻、繼承等領域與成文法並存，婦女團體長期呼籲統一法律標準。改革草案若未能消除這種並行，反而可能讓習慣法獲得更大空間。","法律改革若缺乏女性群體實質參與，容易出現形式上平等、實踐中倒退的結果。婦女團體的反對是一種監督，提醒決策者不能只看條文辭令，還要看女性在日常生活中的真實處境。"],"why":"憲法審查本應是擴大平等的機會，婦女團體卻站出來拒絕改革方向，這種反向動作值得追問。","en":{"t":"Ghanaian women's groups reject gender equality reforms in constitutional review","d":"Women's groups are pushing back against proposed constitutional reforms they say fail to protect women's rights.","body":["During Ghana's constitutional review, women's groups have rejected certain gender equality proposals, warning they may weaken protections.","Statutory and customary law coexist, and women have long demanded alignment. The groups see the draft as insufficient or harmful."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Ghana News Agency","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxObS1PMzlUSzh2RFh4MzVwU1p1SGRQVVFMZTNVNjRCajZtQS1wREtzOVM5Y1J5bEN0aVkya1RFRHZoSGZHZHJ0cFNFSjVCdi1YemJBaHdyN2Mzbmg2MG1ILXd0Vk1vZmprcHhnRm5MaEVCLWRvQ3RjR29nckNpWW8xM1l6bHZqa2VqQ2o2VkFEVEpLbS1ZTnV4ZkNEM0FkUQ?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"003-4","t":"英自由民主黨在女性權利議題上被批懦弱","d":"英國自由民主黨在跨性別與女性權利等議題上的立場遭批評，被指回避明確原則，在核心性別議題上表現軟弱。","body":["有評論批評英國自由民主黨在女性權利相關問題上態度含糊，尤其是在跨性別政策與單性別空間爭論中缺乏決斷。該黨被指不敢明確表態，以免失去部分選民。","英國圍繞性別承認法、體育與監獄中的性別分類長期爭議，政黨常因擔心疏遠部分選民而回避立場。這種政治計算使女性權利與跨性別權益之間的公共討論更加極化。","政黨若在女性權利與跨性別權益之間選擇模糊，可能兩頭不討好，也讓基層女性感到被忽視。清晰立場不只是政治責任，也關係到公共政策的可預期性。"],"why":"一個自稱自由主義的政黨在女性權利上不敢表態，這種反差暴露出政治計算優先於原則。","en":{"t":"UK Lib Dems accused of cowardice on women's rights","d":"Critics say the Liberal Democrats have avoided clear positions on contested gender and women's rights issues.","body":["The UK Liberal Democrats face criticism for vague stances on women's rights, especially around transgender policy and single-sex spaces.","Party caution on contested issues may alienate both sides. Observers argue clarity is needed for trust."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"telegraph.co.uk","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPYll3RVdQMGZNdERqTElPd01peEd1ZGtVOXc1RGpZYm1MSjVvNUhMUGJ4dzIwTEg2U1VQOVQwd0lXWm9sMldxSFVnaGNoZkJjcjUtdDRQX25nb0F4REZQV3NxZkpWU2NOZTRhNWszTVFJZk1zaVhmZWI1Ml8xRGIxQ3VhZGZzekE1S2c?oc=5","region":"歐洲"},{"id":"003-5","t":"埃及全國婦女委員會稱婦女權利立法取得重要進展","d":"埃及全國婦女委員會表示，在保護婦女權益相關法律文件中取得重要立法突破，涉及針對性暴力與家庭關係等領域的保障強化。","body":["埃及全國婦女委員會宣佈在維護婦女權益的法律領域出現重要進展，稱多項相關文件得到推進。官方機構主動強調立法成績，試圖展現國家在婦女權利方面的努力。","埃及近年修訂部分法律，對性騷擾、女性割禮等作出更嚴厲規定，但執法與社會汙名仍是挑戰。許多女性仍不敢報案，法律條文與日常保護之間存在落差。","官方機構主動強調立法成績，既可能是真實進步，也可能服務於國際形象。需要觀察法律能否轉化為日常保護，而非只停留在紙面上的進步敘事。"],"why":"婦女委員會把多項法律修改稱為“重要立法突破”，但具體細節和落實成效仍待檢驗。","en":{"t":"Egypt's National Council for Women reports legislative progress","d":"The state women's body highlights advances in laws protecting women's rights.","body":["Egypt's National Council for Women says important legislative progress has been made in files related to women's protection.","Past reforms targeted harassment and FGM, but enforcement and stigma remain. The announcement may signal both reform and image-building."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"صدى البلد","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiR0FVX3lxTE9kNE5ia1c3a0Izd0ZDUG5nbDVneHplQzZXenJvUkdCU3hYSFhkX0EyWnRCSWpOeXNOSy1sYzA1cF9TWEJxMVJZ?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"003-6","t":"尼泊爾女性爭取所耕種土地的所有權","d":"尼泊爾許多女性長期從事農業生產，卻因法律與社會慣例無法擁有土地。她們正推動土地所有權改革，以保障生計、借貸和家庭決策地位。","body":["尼泊爾農村女性承擔主要農作勞動，但土地登記多在男性名下。報道指出，女性希望獲得她們實際耕種土地的所有權，以改變依附狀態，而不是繼續只出力不落名。","尼泊爾法律近年雖有賦予女性財產權的條款，但執行受父權習俗、文件缺失與意識不足阻礙。土地是獲得貸款、參與村務的基礎資源，沒有地契，女性往往被排除在公共事務之外。","土地所有權不只關乎財產，還直接影響女性在家庭與社區中的議價能力，是打破貧困循環和性別從屬的關鍵。當女性擁有土地，她們更可能投資子女教育並參與決策。"],"why":"她們每天都在土地上勞作，卻不能以自己名義登記產權，這種反差常被髮展議題忽略。","en":{"t":"Nepali women seek ownership of the land they farm","d":"Women who till the land are demanding legal recognition as owners to secure livelihoods and standing.","body":["Women in Nepal do much of the agricultural work yet rarely hold land titles. They are pressing for ownership rights over the fields they cultivate.","Though laws grant women property rights, patriarchal customs and weak implementation keep land in men's names. Ownership is key to credit, autonomy, and local influence."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"news - Mongabay","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"南亞"},{"id":"003-7","t":"厄瓜多爾為何難以遏制殺害女性案件","d":"厄瓜多爾殺害女性案件頻發，儘管法律已設立相關罪名，執法與預防仍存在斷層。報道探討暴力高發背後的制度失效與性別偏見。","body":["厄瓜多爾近年將殺害女性列為特定犯罪，但案件數量仍令人擔憂。報道追問，為何法律明確後女性仍不安全，問題顯然不止於立法層面。","拉美地區長期存在高謀殺率與性別暴力文化，警方與司法系統常輕視家庭暴力報案，預防措施和庇護資源不足。許多女性在遇害前已多次求助，卻未被認真對待。","僅將行為入罪不夠，若報案不被認真對待、施害者鮮少受罰，法律威懾力有限。殺害女性是性別不平等的極端表現，需要從執法與預防同時著手。"],"why":"法律已經將殺害女性單獨立罪，但女性被殺的數量仍然沒有降下來，說明問題不止於立法。","en":{"t":"Why Ecuador struggles to stop femicide","d":"Despite criminalizing femicide, Ecuador continues to see high rates of deadly violence against women.","body":["Ecuador has made femicide a distinct crime, yet killings of women remain alarming. Gaps in enforcement and prevention are under scrutiny.","Gender-based violence is widespread, and authorities often downplay domestic violence reports. Without protection and accountability, the law's impact is limited."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"DW.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFA5Q2pSMWN5UGZjYUpKRTNDRXBCMURPbVZjRVdqV3dscS1wWTMtU09DZXZ2OTE1YmQyQUhTUWVZMHlPSWFzRDJWTTRLb3NSSFNISGpyNnpPUzlTdnMyd2VsdWRIcFZNRGpZdUJIYkhHOVNuaVVINlE?oc=5","region":"拉美"},{"id":"003-8","t":"加拿大原住民婦女宣言：保護女性與土地免受大型項目暴力","d":"加拿大原住民婦女發佈宣言，將大型開發項目帶來的環境破壞與針對原住民婦女的暴力聯繫起來，要求停止掠奪性開發。","body":["UBCIC發佈婦女宣言，指出大型項目在破壞土地的同時，也加劇針對原住民婦女的暴力風險。她們把土地權利與人身安全視為一體，認為不能只保護土地而不保護土地上的人。","加拿大原住民婦女長期面臨高暴力風險，資源開採項目常帶來外來工人、治安惡化和社區失序，已有調查關注失蹤與被謀殺原住民婦女。宣言將環境正義與性別正義相結合。","將環境正義與性別正義結合，挑戰了將經濟發展置於社區安全之上的邏輯，也提醒主流女權運動不應忽視原住民女性。破壞土地和傷害婦女常常來自同一套掠奪邏輯。"],"why":"宣言把土地破壞和婦女暴力放在同一個框架裡，這在大型項目爭議中並不常見。","en":{"t":"Indigenous women's declaration in Canada links land protection to ending violence","d":"UBCIC women connect major project violence to harms against Indigenous women and demand land protections.","body":["The UBCIC Women's Declaration says large projects on Indigenous lands worsen violence against women. It ties environmental destruction to community safety.","The declaration challenges both resource extraction and the neglect of missing and murdered Indigenous women, joining gender and land justice."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png","src":"ubcic.bc.ca","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNV1RlQmpSVXV3MkpWMVEzd21HRmJJUTVFUGVVNTJZQ054NGduTE1KSFNtTFVNZjhjVmtBYmk4cEpiVFlfZVJFUWc3SnJEUWNDWVBpSEFFTjlleVFuRGZzZXhpYjVaU2pOdVVqeUlTei1NZU1kOGpJZVBTcVZYNWRpSUNaMU1xOFdTSzl3?oc=5","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"003-9","t":"墨西哥瓜納華托州尋求強化產婦權利保護","d":"墨西哥瓜納華托州擬加強女性在孕產期間的權利保障，涉及醫療與勞動保護，旨在減少孕期歧視和健康風險。","body":["墨西哥瓜納華托州提出或討論加強女性在生育期間的權益保護，重點是孕產期女性的醫療和勞動保障。保護懷孕和生育期間的權利，聽起來基礎，卻仍需要地方立法來強調。","墨西哥女性在懷孕期間常面臨職場歧視、解僱風險與醫療條件不足，孕產婦健康不平等問題突出。許多女性因擔心失去工作而不敢懷孕或不敢休產假。","將保護從紙面落實到醫療與勞動實踐，是保障女性生育自主與身體權利的基礎。如果孕期被解僱、產檢資源不足等問題持續存在，那麼法律上的平等就是空話。"],"why":"保護女性在懷孕和生育期間的權利，聽起來基礎，卻仍需要地方立法來強調，說明執行很薄弱。","en":{"t":"Guanajuato seeks stronger protections for women during maternity","d":"Mexican state moves to reinforce rights for women during pregnancy and maternity.","body":["Guanajuato is working to strengthen protections for women's rights during maternity, including healthcare and labor safeguards.","Pregnancy-related discrimination and unequal maternal care remain challenges. The effort aims to turn legal rights into practice."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"MILENIO","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"文化","en_cat":"Culture","items":[{"id":"003-10","t":"巴西女性權利倡導者Nágila Brito獲“不朽”稱號","d":"巴西女性權利捍衛者Nágila Brito因其在維護婦女權益方面的行動獲得榮譽稱號，表彰她在相關領域的長期投入。","body":["Nágila Brito 因在維護女性權利方面的突出行動獲得“不朽者”稱號。這一榮譽來自巴西相關機構，用以表彰她在女性權益領域的持續努力。","巴西女性面臨高暴力率與政治代表不足，許多地方行動者在基層提供法律援助與庇護。Nágila Brito 的工作屬於這種社區層面的日常抗爭，未必出現在全國性頭條中。","對基層女性權利倡導者的認可，有助於將關注引向日常實踐而非僅法律條文。當一位並非全國知名的人物獲得稱號，地方層面的努力就被看見了。"],"why":"一位並非全國知名的女性權利行動者獲得“不朽”稱號，說明地方層面的努力被看見。","en":{"t":"Brazilian women's rights advocate Nágila Brito receives title","d":"Nágila Brito is honored for her work defending women's rights in Brazil.","body":["Nágila Brito received an \"Immortal\" title for her advocacy for women's rights. The honor recognizes grassroots commitment.","Her work highlights the role of local defenders in a country with high gender violence and underrepresentation."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png","src":"Taktá No AR","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOLVlzc3YtemxicUVRR3BpZ3N6bl9lc0hDZ2ZHVGtCWmJOVXZnUDdPRTdaTkNIQzhQRjhSeF85V2dOd2VFbV9wWHd1anpCM3FRTzRnY1owMm1HTEhUZU9wQnZSRkNTTFNQbzFLNktZNU01NDJRNEdqOTJxR2pfQ0ZSRnRZNExuVHdFbU9ZbzJGd2wwcFRTbkJVcGdJT3YtX01LMjBIUkdvNFdYUnV5UXB4SWJJQXpVTWlNQ0E?oc=5","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"003-11","t":"生育權利倒退之際，美國郵政發行紀念作家朱厄特郵票","d":"美國郵政在生育權利受挫背景下發行紀念作家薩拉·奧恩·朱厄特的郵票，她曾描繪女性在婚姻之外的生活可能。","body":["美國生育權利面臨倒退，此時美國郵政發行紀念作家 Sarah Orne Jewett 的郵票。她以描寫女性獨立生活而知名，作品展現女性不依附婚姻的可能性。","美國多州限制墮胎後，女性自主選擇空間縮小。朱厄特的作品提醒人們，女性可以擁有生育之外的人生道路，這種文學想像在當下具有現實意義。","一枚郵票在此時出現，既是對女性文學傳統的肯定，也提醒公眾生育自主與女性生活道路選擇密切相關。當法律收緊時，文化表達成為另一種抵抗。"],"why":"在生育權利被壓縮的時候發行紀念一位書寫女性不婚生活的作家郵票，時機本身就像一種表態。","en":{"t":"Amid reproductive rollbacks, USPS honors author Sarah Orne Jewett","d":"A new stamp honors a writer who imagined women's lives beyond marriage as reproductive rights are curtailed.","body":["The USPS has issued a stamp for Sarah Orne Jewett, known for depicting women's independent lives. It comes amid reproductive rights rollbacks.","The stamp highlights literary visions of female autonomy at a time when bodily self-determination is under legal attack."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png","src":"Ms. Magazine","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOZjhiVWMwZU1ISnIyWmcxTUpEcHhPX0VJQTNZdThjQXZUdmFEdEVWRFNDUmxJRmVwcmFlRHJJY254WGkyTGlQZEVfZjRPQ0lsYnFjRXJTTDUzMUdtd3lhaU00MDk0MGJ0V3o1UGtncGtBVkFaTmVLTWZVYzBid0tmdlZtdy0?oc=5","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"003-12","t":"提高女性在軍隊中的工作效能以推動性別平等","d":"東南亞地區討論提高女性在軍隊環境中的工作效能，以促進軍隊內部性別平等與女性職業發展。","body":["有報道關注如何提高女性在軍隊中的工作效能，以推動軍事環境中的性別平等和女性進步。軍隊作為權力最集中的機構之一，其性別平等進展可影響更廣的社會規範。","軍隊長期以男性為主導，女性常面臨晉升受限、性騷擾與制度排斥。提升效能需結構性改革，而不只是增加女性人數，還要改變評價體系和日常文化。","如果連最保守的軍隊都開始談性別平等，說明其他行業的藉口更站不住腳。軍隊中的變化可能產生示範效應，讓更多機構重新審視自己的性別盲區。"],"why":"在強調紀律和服從的軍隊裡討論女性晉升和效能，本身就是對舊結構的挑戰。","en":{"t":"Improving women's effectiveness in the military to advance gender equality","d":"Calls to enhance women's roles and effectiveness in military settings aim to promote gender equality.","body":["A report highlights efforts to improve women's effectiveness and equality in the military. It discusses structural barriers to advancement.","As a male-dominated institution, the military requires targeted reforms to address discrimination and promote women's progress."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png","src":"Vietnam.vn","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQWGd0ODMxOVdLTmwzQVJaQzJpZFNNeG1uQWFLbGZmSEhMWDRRTmhhM2ZFVng3aVVkLWdvRUVQM1NrNW9yVWt4NHhZRnUzR1dUZk1MSDZ1R0EyYWpDMVNRVjExTW4xSHQ2ME15eXlPRFZYb1M1RnF2bWdGUnhJN0FTUkVzcjJOZ2p0NXVTaktGMmZNLWlUTG8wcnFlZTVDRHBsV3RxVzBsS3JHTU1YaG1Z?oc=5","region":"東南亞"}]}]},{"id":"002","date":"2026-09-18","period":"2026.09.14 – 2026.09.20","title":"性別平等倒計時與女性行動","summary":"聯合國警告性別平等仍需171年，韓國擬批准墮胎藥，美國得州與南非案件凸顯女性健康與安全危機；埃及、法國、巴西等地從職場、世俗性與地方治理推進權利討論。","en":{"title":"Gender Equality Countdown and Women's Actions","summary":"UN warns gender parity is still 171 years away, South Korea plans to approve abortion pills, cases in Texas and South Africa expose health and safety crises; Egypt, France and Brazil advance rights debates."},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","watch":{"name":"Michèle Vianès","name_en":"Michèle Vianès","role":"女性權利與世俗主義評論者","role_en":"Commentator on women's rights and secularism","region":"歐洲","why":"她在里昂媒體訪談中提出，世俗性是女性自主的必要條件而非充分條件，將宗教約束與制度支持放在同一分析框架裡，為法國爭論提供更平衡的視角。","why_en":"She argued that secularism is necessary but not sufficient for women's autonomy, linking religious constraints with institutional support.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","img":""},"picks":{"film":"出走的決心","book":"第二性","art":"弗裡達·卡羅"},"sections":[{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"002-1","t":"聯合國警告：性別平等仍須171年","d":"聯合國新報告警告，女性權力正被削減，按當前速度實現全面性別平等還需171年，多個領域出現倒退。","body":["聯合國最新報告警示，女性在領導職位與公共領域的權力正在被削減，按當前速度實現全面性別平等還需171年。報告指出多個國家女性政治和經濟參與度下降，制度性承諾出現倒退。","報告將倒退歸因於部分國家削弱婦女權利機構、反性別議程抬頭以及氣候與衝突危機中對女性的忽視。過去幾年女性在議會、企業高管和司法系統的比例增長緩慢，某些地區甚至回落。","這一倒計時並非抽象數字；它意味著出生在今天的女孩在其有生之年仍可能面對法律、薪資與安全的不平等。報告呼籲把女性權利納入財政與社會政策核心，而非作為邊緣議題。"],"why":"171年的推算把遙遠的不平等變成一個可感知的時間長度，暴露承諾與行動的巨大落差。","en":{"t":"UN: Gender Equality Still 171 Years Away","d":"A new UN report warns women's power is being cut back, and at current pace full gender parity will take 171 years.","body":["The UN says women's power in leadership and public life is being cut back, with full gender equality 171 years away at the current pace. Several countries saw declines in women's political and economic participation.","The report blames weakened women's rights institutions, rising anti-gender agendas, and the neglect of women in climate and conflict crises. It calls for women's rights to be central to fiscal and social policy."]},"img":"assets/img/podium.png?v=3","src":"Devdiscourse","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"全球"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"002-2","t":"韓國擬明年批准墮胎藥","d":"韓國計劃明年批准藥物墮胎，結束多年僅允許手術墮胎的限制，改善女性終止妊娠的可及性與隱私。","body":["韓國政府計劃在明年批准墮胎藥的使用。此前藥物墮胎在韓國長期未獲正式許可，有需要的女性多依賴手術或其他路徑，在時間與費用上承受額外負擔。","韓國憲法法院此前已裁定將墮胎全面入罪違憲，但配套立法與藥品審批推進緩慢。醫學上，藥物終止妊娠常用於孕早期，侵入性較低且隱私性更高，但其合法化需要配套的處方與隨訪制度。","若獲批，韓國女性將多一種不必進入手術室的選擇，這在醫療資源集中在都市的地區尤其重要。爭議在於藥品上市後的費用是否納入醫保，以及偏遠地區能否獲得規範用藥指導。"],"why":"韓國墮胎早已非罪，藥物墮胎卻拖到明年才可能獲批，法律與醫療選項長期脫節。","en":{"t":"South Korea Expected to Approve Abortion Pills Next Year","d":"Seoul plans to approve medication abortion, expanding options beyond surgery after years of delay.","body":["South Korea plans to approve abortion pills next year, giving women a non-surgical option after long delays. The move follows a court ruling that criminalizing abortion was unconstitutional.","Medication abortion is used for early pregnancy and offers more privacy, but approval requires prescription and follow-up systems. Cost coverage and access outside major cities remain contentious."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png?v=3","src":"yahoo.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPbmw2cVFack9UMnBpcXFwaU9jMzYyTkttZV9ya3MxR3VEdHlGcmJsYVdyUmN6OElqLUpUckdYM0tCNUpKLURvd1hnN2ZSMFJKUTNZMW9yX1ByRWtqRFkyRWxid2xlR0I0aE9rYm5lQVJNNXhyNGdnQ0o2bVlYY0ZZRGNSSHFSODZ6OG8xVnhIWFpTaFE?oc=5","region":"東亞"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"002-3","t":"訴訟：得州墮胎禁令導致孕婦死亡","d":"美國得州一名孕婦據稱因墮胎禁令延誤救治而死亡，其家屬提起訴訟，再度引發對孕產健康與限制性法律衝突的關注。","body":["一項在美國得州提起的訴訟稱，該州墮胎禁令導致一名孕婦死亡。原告主張醫療人員因法律風險未能及時提供終止妊娠處理，延誤了必要治療，最終造成悲劇。","得州實施嚴格的墮胎限制，許多醫生在高額罰則與刑事風險下，即使面對健康受威脅的孕婦也趨於保守，孕產急救面臨不確定性。","這類案件將抽象的墮胎法律轉化為可驗證的醫療後果，可能影響後續司法審查與立法辯論。它也促使公眾關注：在限制墮胎的州，妊娠併發症和產科急症是否得到同等保護。"],"why":"死亡訴訟把墮胎爭論從道德立場拉回到醫療現實，法律可能正在產生直接傷害。","en":{"t":"Lawsuit: Texas Abortion Ban Caused Pregnant Woman's Death","d":"A lawsuit in Texas claims the state's abortion ban led to a pregnant woman's death by delaying necessary care.","body":["The suit says medical providers feared legal consequences and failed to provide timely termination, leading to the woman's death. Texas has strict abortion limits with high penalties.","The case turns abstract abortion law into measurable health outcomes and may influence judicial review. It raises questions about equal protection for pregnancy complications in restrictive states."]},"img":"assets/img/body-choice.png?v=3","src":"NBC News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQUTYxZUUxVi1hZmFZQVRKYllTNGdyOXMwNmJfa3VyRTlkNTVGTHhxS2dpNGJBa0dhcmpJQkZ2dVlYZ0FJRE9QLUFQV0Z1d05BR1J1Tlh3OExQZXRnd01MSmR4Yms3Q2YwdzlCc1hSOXFkQTlaMFg2WDhkUTZXR3E2RUZLcWxpLThrSFgtckdNdXdXNHRESTFRMWxLYUFsQ3hDeGpETlNORklsdEtOd0FyekVvSndDZw?oc=5","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"002-4","t":"南非系列殺害女性案發現第九具遺體","d":"南非調查針對女性的連環殺害案時，發現第九具女性遺體，性別暴力問題再度成為全國焦點。","body":["南非警方在調查一系列以女性為目標的殺害案件時，發現第九具女性遺體。屍體被發現地點與先前案件存在關聯，警方尚未確認是否同一兇手，但已成立專案組。","南非長期面臨高發的基於性別的暴力與殺害。犯罪率高企、執法資源不足和貧困使女性處於風險之中，家暴與陌生人暴力交織，許多案件未能及時偵破。","連續發現遺體暴露出女性人身安全的系統性危機，民間組織呼籲將性別暴力視為國家緊急狀態。案件也促使公眾質疑警方在早期是否忽視失蹤報案與社區線索。"],"why":"九具遺體並非孤立兇案，而是同一地區女性不斷遇害的連續信號。","en":{"t":"Ninth Body Found in South Africa Serial Killings of Women","d":"South African police found a ninth body while probing a series of killings targeting women, intensifying focus on gender-based violence.","body":["The body was found in an area linked to previous cases, and police have formed a task team. South Africa faces high rates of gender-based violence, with many cases unsolved.","The deaths expose a systemic crisis in women's safety, and activists demand that gender violence be treated as a national emergency. Questions are raised about early police response to missing women."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","src":"Al Jazeera","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"非洲"},{"id":"002-5","t":"法國評論：世俗性是女性自主的必要條件而非充分條件","d":"里昂媒體刊出Michèle Vianès訪談，認為世俗性保護女性免受宗教約束，但不是女性自主的充分條件，還需制度與教育支持。","body":["法國評論者Michèle Vianès在里昂媒體訪談中表示，世俗性本身不足以讓女性成為自主個體，但它是不可或缺的條件。她認為剝離宗教對公共生活的控制，為女性獨立選擇創造了空間。","在法國，圍繞穆斯林頭巾、性別平等與共和價值觀的爭論持續多年。世俗主義常被不同陣營用作工具，或強調個體自由，或強調公共秩序，女性權益處於交叉地帶。","該觀點提出一個平衡點：反對宗教對女性的強制，但也要警惕用世俗主義壓制文化身份或忽視經濟結構。女性自主需要教育、就業和反歧視法律的共同支撐。"],"why":"把世俗性定位為條件而非答案，跳出了宗教自由與女性權利非此即彼的簡單對立。","en":{"t":"French Commentator: Secularism Is Necessary but Not Sufficient for Women's Autonomy","d":"Michèle Vianès argues in Lyon Capitale that secularism is an indispensable condition but not a complete answer for women's autonomy.","body":["She says removing religion from public life creates space for women's independent choices. In France, debates over headscarves and republican values often use secularism as a political tool.","Her position balances opposition to religious coercion with concern about using secularism to suppress cultural identity. Autonomy requires education, employment and anti-discrimination law."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","src":"Lyon Capitale","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"歐洲"},{"id":"002-6","t":"澳大利亞性別平等排名創史上最高","d":"澳大利亞在最新性別平等排名中取得有史以來最好成績，男女在教育、就業與政治領域的差距縮小，但仍未完全消除。","body":["澳大利亞在最新發布的性別平等排名中，男女平等程度創下有記錄以來最高。報道顯示，該國在教育程度、勞動參與和政治代表性上的性別差距有所縮小。","澳大利亞在女性教育水平上長期領先，但職場隔離、無償照料負擔和薪資差距仍存在。排名提升更多反映部分領域改善，而非結構性障礙的全面消除。","排名可作為政策參考，但也可能掩蓋邊緣群體中差距擴大的現實。移民、原住民和低收入女性的處境未必與平均值同步改善，需要更細化的數據評估。"],"why":"排名提升容易製造樂觀，但平均值會掩蓋特定女性群體的停滯甚至倒退。","en":{"t":"Australia Records Best-Ever Gender Equality Ranking","d":"Australia achieved its highest gender equality ranking, but structural gaps in work and care remain hidden by averages.","body":["Improvements in education, participation and political representation drove the ranking, but job segregation and pay gaps persist.","The average may mask widening inequality for migrants, Indigenous and low-income women, requiring more granular data."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","src":"Yahoo News Australia","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5sRnp6UHV3R2FISnRQbklMWTVOOG9RZTZJeDlkaFA0UEQxdWhocFVwUGVscGhRWDZ2Q3VmNkhjbWhoelJoTkwyS0FNYThnV2xteXBQWDBVUnJ6RkwzUm45Z0RobHFKUldyWjhuOEthQmo4OWlQUmdIWU93?oc=5","region":"大洋洲"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"002-7","t":"埃及媒體討論女性薪酬權與決策參與","d":"埃及官方媒體刊文討論女性獲得同等報酬與參與決策的權利，呼籲在經濟與治理中推動性別平等。","body":["埃及國家媒體發表文章，討論女性在職場獲得同等報酬和參與決策的權利。文章指出，女性經濟參與雖有進展，但薪資差距和決策層中的缺席仍限制其影響力。","中東多國女性勞動參與率低於全球水平，文化規範和育兒責任常將女性擠出正式就業。決策結構中的男性主導使涉及女性利益的政策難以被優先考慮。","文章將薪酬與決策權聯繫起來，強調經濟賦權不僅關乎個人收入，也改變家庭和社會中的權力分配。實現這些權利需要法律執行與企業治理的持續壓力。"],"why":"官方媒體主動討論薪酬與決策權，說明該議題已進入體制話語，但仍停留在呼籲層面。","en":{"t":"Egyptian Media Discuss Women's Right to Equal Pay and Decision-Making","d":"Egypt's state media published an article on women's equal pay and participation in decision-making, urging progress in the economy and governance.","body":["The article notes that despite women's economic advancement, wage gaps and absence from decision-making limit their influence. Cultural norms and care responsibilities push women out of formal employment.","Linking pay with decision-making shows economic empowerment changes power in family and society. Progress requires legal enforcement and corporate governance pressure."]},"img":"assets/img/workplace.png?v=3","src":"الهيئة الوطنية للإعلام","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"002-8","t":"巴西馬利利亞擴大婦女權利委員會社會參與","d":"巴西馬利利亞市擴大婦女權利委員會的社會參與，加強民間組織在政策制定中的角色，提升性別議題地方治理代表性。","body":["巴西馬利利亞市政府宣佈擴大婦女權利委員會的社會參與，吸納更多民間組織與女性代表進入諮詢與決策過程。該舉措旨在讓地方性別政策更貼近實際需求。","巴西在婦女權利和反家暴領域有較高法律標準，但政策執行常受地方財政與保守勢力影響。市政委員會是連接法律與社區的重要機制，此前常因代表性不足而功能有限。","擴大參與有利於將分散的婦女服務與訴求納入制度化渠道，但真正的挑戰在於委員會建議能否轉化為預算與行動。地方治理的透明度與執行承諾決定其成效。"],"why":"婦女委員會擴權看似程序性調整，實則改變誰能在地方政策中發聲的權力分佈。","en":{"t":"Marília Expands Social Participation in Women's Rights Council","d":"The Brazilian city of Marília expanded social participation in its Municipal Council for Women's Rights, strengthening civil society's role in policy.","body":["The move brings more civil organizations and women representatives into consultation and decision-making, aiming to align local gender policy with needs.","The challenge is translating council recommendations into budget and action. Local transparency and enforcement will determine whether participation leads to real change."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","src":"conexaomarilia.com.br","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNTEpIdU9hRFkyeTlITkczWXIzNEFwbXo0eWsxZ0taUEJNSV83cmZ6ekxWQ2Z5TElOZnNlTGFoWWgzMUJSbm85UWJqOFBDS1lLLV9CUFNydjZQWHd5aTBvcEREMHp3ZTJWbjd0dnZlc0NGaEI5d0FXd3lnWjl1LTc3ZnI1U2hDUVpHSGthRWUxOV9ldTNkWWcybXMtNWZ0WHhSdnRBdGkxYVZobUlUdHdwSHZSVEhuaTRROXd3aVQyckcwd2Z4?oc=5","region":"拉美"},{"id":"002-9","t":"斯里蘭卡評論：女性權利關乎實質平等","d":"斯里蘭卡媒體刊文指出，女性權利的核心是實質平等而非僅形式平等，需消除結果上的差距和結構性障礙。","body":["斯里蘭卡媒體評論指出，女性權利不能停留在法律條文的形式平等，而應追求實質平等。作者強調，即使法律禁止歧視，資源和機會分配上的差距仍使女性處於不利地位。","南亞多國在憲法與勞動法中都有平等條款，但土地繼承、非正式就業和家庭照料的不平等使女性難以實現經濟獨立。性別配額等政策往往面臨實施軟化和地方阻力。","實質平等的概念要求正視歷史累積的不利，並在就業、教育、社會保障等方面採取積極措施。這對政策制定者提出更高標準，也引發關於特殊措施是否造成反向歧視的爭論。"],"why":"把焦點從權利義務拉向結果差距，暴露了紙面平等與實際生活之間的脫節。","en":{"t":"Sri Lankan Commentary: Women's Rights Are About Substantive Equality","d":"A Sri Lankan article argues that women's rights require substantive equality, not just formal legal provisions, to close outcome gaps.","body":["Even where discrimination is banned, gaps in resources and opportunity keep women disadvantaged. South Asian legal equality often fails against unequal land, informal work and care burdens.","Substantive equality demands positive measures in employment, education and social protection, but also raises debate about reverse discrimination."]},"img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","src":"themorning.lk","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xRk12UURFUzFyVW1PTHJLanlRQ0FNWXhjcVJQaXFQcDZLa3BKN1B5UHVtXzNTc0pZV3JNN2U4aUZhTWd4MFNOaWk3ZGV5dERyZkdTem9pY2g1cTRfMzVremxHdjVMZw?oc=5","region":"南亞"}]},{"cat":"體育","en_cat":"Sports","items":[{"id":"002-10","t":"菲律賓女籃亞運會首戰力克哈薩克斯坦","d":"菲律賓Gilas女籃在亞運會首場比賽中大勝哈薩克斯坦，為賽事取得開門紅，團隊表現亮眼。","body":["菲律賓Gilas女籃在亞運會首場比賽中擊敗哈薩克斯坦隊，以強勢表現開啟賽事征程。球隊在攻防兩端佔據主動，為晉級目標奠定基礎。","東南亞女子籃球長期缺乏曝光與資源，菲律賓近年通過海外訓練和聯賽改革提升競爭力。國家隊成績被視為推動女性參與體育和爭取職業機會的重要窗口。","女子比賽的成績能吸引更多年輕女性投身運動，但獎牌之外，薪酬、轉播和贊助的不平等仍是區域女籃面臨的共同困境。賽事曝光帶來的關注度能否轉化為長期投入仍需觀察。"],"why":"女籃國家隊大勝不易，但這類消息通常只在綜合運動會期間得到短暫關注。","en":{"t":"Philippines' Gilas Women Dominate Kazakhstan in Asian Games Opener","d":"The Philippine women's basketball team beat Kazakhstan in its first Asian Games match, starting the campaign strongly.","body":["The team controlled both ends and set a foundation for advancing. Southeast Asian women's basketball has lacked exposure and resources, with recent reforms boosting competitiveness.","Sustained funding and media visibility remain challenges beyond medals. The performance may inspire young women but needs institutional support to translate into long-term change."]},"img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","src":"ABS-CBN","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNb1NuTFpPN2NwaWVpTWZKaXhHcjJ0aFdKbFc0enpmMk13T0hvUXN3aEhfMlBMSk9mNV96Z2lvU2VYTzJsVk00R0tvOVM0Q2RQUHVOOHB6NzFVM3JyWWtrWkllQ3ZZaHlYUkltN2RWQThSSGU0bHhCSHlHOGVFRlpaakdqYk5ERmFub0x4LVQ2eXlPdkNoYTNhR1IxN0M2WXRUVF9kbkp0VGxCY2wwVE9hVFJCTFd1dTJ6aDlWVjB2clNfYzQ?oc=5","region":"東南亞"}]}]},{"id":"001","img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","date":"2026-09-17","period":"2026.09.14 – 2026.09.20","title":"她照亮歷史：金獅、法案與“120年”之問","en":{"title":"She Lights Up History: A Golden Lion, a New Law, and the 120-Year Question","summary":"This week's global roundup: May el-Toukhy wins Venice's Golden Lion, France moves to tighten sexual-violence laws, the WEF warns gender parity is still 120 years away, and Mexico's abortion win inspires the US."},"summary":"本期覆蓋全球、歐洲、北美、拉美、中東、非洲、東亞、南亞、大洋洲與中國：梅爾·圖琪摘金獅，法國推進打擊性暴力法案，世經論壇警告全球性別平等還需120年，墨西哥墮胎權勝利啟示美國，日本性別平等排名繼續G7墊底。","sections":[{"cat":"國際","en_cat":"International","items":[{"id":"001-1","img":"assets/img/vote.png?v=3","t":"世界經濟論壇：全球性別平等還需120年","d":"世界經濟論壇最新報告警告：按當前速度，全球性別平等仍需要約120年才能實現，呼籲各國加快縮小差距。","en":{"t":"WEF: Global Gender Parity Is Still 120 Years Away","d":"The World Economic Forum's latest report warns that at the current pace, full global gender parity will take about 120 years — and urges governments and business to accelerate.","body":["\"Gender parity is still 120 years away.\" That is the sobering headline of the World Economic Forum's latest Global Gender Gap Report, which tracks gaps in economic participation, education, health and political empowerment.","The widest gap remains in economic participation: unequal pay, the leadership ceiling and the unequal distribution of unpaid care work continue to slow women's advancement. Education gaps have largely closed — yet that progress has not automatically translated into equality at work and in decision-making.","The report urges governments and companies to treat gender equality as a core agenda, not a side topic: expanding paid parental leave, raising women's representation on boards and in parliaments, and investing in women's health and digital skills."]},"body":["“全球性別平等還需120年。”這是世界經濟論壇最新一期全球性別差距報告給出的判斷。報告追蹤經濟參與、教育、健康與政治賦權四大維度，指出全球性別差距雖在緩慢收窄，但速度遠不足以讓這一代人看到終點。","報告特別指出，經濟參與與機會是差距最大的領域之一：同工不同酬、職業天花板與照護勞動的不平等分配，仍在系統性拖慢女性進入關鍵崗位的速度。教育維度的差距已基本彌合，但並未自動轉化為職場與決策層的平等。","報告呼籲各國政府與企業將性別平等納入核心議程，而不僅是“附加議題”：擴大帶薪育兒假、提高女性在董事會與政壇的比例、投資女性健康與數字技能，都被列為加速路徑。"],"src":"TRT中文","url":"https://www.trtzhongwen.com/article/1e667f50d109","region":"全球"},{"id":"001-2","img":"assets/img/podium.png?v=3","t":"聯合國婦女署出席第81屆聯合國大會","d":"聯合國婦女署在聯大期間發聲：性別平等議程“從未如此相關”，呼籲以國家領導力與持續夥伴關係推進婦女議題。","en":{"t":"UN Women at the 81st UN General Assembly","d":"At this year's General Assembly, UN Women declares that the gender-equality mandate has \"never been more relevant\", calling for national leadership and sustained partnership.","body":["As the 81st session of the UN General Assembly convenes, UN Women has issued a clear message: the gender-equality mandate is more urgent than ever. From women and girls in conflict zones to women workers hit hardest by economic crises, the cost of inequality is increasingly visible.","\"You gave us a mandate that has never been more relevant,\" UN Women said, urging member states to back commitments with national leadership, institutions and sustained funding — especially as progress on Sustainable Development Goal 5 lags.","During the Assembly, UN Women will hold side events and high-level dialogues on women's economic empowerment, ending violence against women, and women's participation in peace and security."]},"body":["在第81屆聯合國大會召開之際，聯合國婦女署發佈媒體公告與講話，重申性別平等在全球議程中的優先地位。婦女署指出，從衝突地區的婦女與女童，到經濟危機中首當其衝的女性勞動者，性別不平等的代價正在被越來越清晰地看見。","婦女署強調，“你們賦予我們的使命從未如此相關”。在實現2030可持續發展目標（尤其是目標5：性別平等）的進程明顯滯後的背景下，婦女署呼籲成員國拿出國家層面的領導力，並以制度與資金的雙重投入兌現承諾。","本屆聯大期間，婦女署將圍繞婦女經濟賦權、結束針對婦女的暴力、以及婦女在和平與安全中的參與等議題開展系列邊會與高級別對話。"],"src":"UN Women","url":"https://www.unwomen.org/en/news-stories/media-advisory/2026/09/un-women-at-the-81st-session-of-the-un-general-assembly-unga-81","region":"全球"},{"id":"001-3","img":"assets/img/workplace.png?v=3","t":"利比里亞：300萬美元倡議推動女性領導力與和平建設","d":"聯合國婦女署與合作伙伴啟動300萬美元倡議，支持利比里亞女性在領導力、司法與和平建設中的參與。","en":{"t":"Liberia: US$3 Million Initiative to Advance Women's Leadership and Peacebuilding","d":"UN Women and partners roll out a US$3 million initiative to strengthen Liberian women's participation in leadership, justice and peacebuilding.","body":["UN Women and partners have launched a US$3 million initiative in Liberia focused on three pillars: women's leadership, justice and peacebuilding. Liberia made history in 2006 by electing Africa's first female head of state, yet women's share of decision-making has not kept growing in the post-war years.","The initiative will build the capacity of grassroots women's organisations, support women candidates in local governance, and improve the justice system's response to gender-based violence. In peacebuilding, women's voices will be woven into community mediation and national dialogue mechanisms.","As UN Women's regional office puts it, in post-conflict countries every additional seat for women in peace processes makes agreements more durable — so this investment is aimed squarely at sustainable peace."]},"body":["聯合國婦女署與合作伙伴宣佈，在利比里亞啟動一項總額300萬美元的新倡議，聚焦三個方向：女性領導力、司法正義與和平建設。利比里亞曾在2006年選出非洲首位民選女總統，但戰後的重建進程並未讓女性在決策層的佔比持續擴大。","倡議將支持基層女性組織的能力建設，幫助女性候選人參與地方治理，並推動司法系統對性別暴力案件的回應。和平建設部分則將女性的聲音納入社區衝突調解與國家對話機制。","婦女署非洲區域辦公室表示，在衝突後國家，女性參與和平進程每增加一分，和平協議的可持續性就提高一分——這筆投資因此被看作對“可持續和平”的直接投入。"],"src":"UN Women Africa","url":"https://africa.unwomen.org/en/stories/news/2026/09/un-women-and-partners-roll-out-us3-million-initiative-to-advance-womens-leadership-justice-and-peacebuilding-in-liberia","region":"非洲"}]},{"cat":"政策與法律","en_cat":"Policy & Law","items":[{"id":"001-4","img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","t":"法國：受“莉安娜案”推動，打擊性暴力法案10月審議","d":"在社會輿論推動下，法國打擊性暴力法案將於10月進入審議，強化對性暴力犯罪的追訴與受害者保護。","en":{"t":"France: Sexual-Violence Bill to Be Reviewed in October, Driven by the 'Liana Case'","d":"Spurred by a high-profile case and public pressure, a French bill strengthening prosecution of sexual violence and victim protection heads to parliamentary review in October.","body":["According to Oushinet (European Times), a French bill toughening the fight against sexual violence will enter parliamentary review in October. Its acceleration is widely linked to the nationwide outcry over the \"Liana case\", which cast doubt on how the justice system handles sexual-violence complaints.","The bill aims to lower evidentiary and prosecution thresholds, extend limitation periods for certain offences, and strengthen procedural protection and support for victims. Advocates argue France's current consent standards and procedures place an unreasonable burden on survivors.","After years of back-and-forth over consent age and the legal definition of sexual violence, this bill — if passed — would rank among the most significant French legislative steps of the post-#MeToo era."]},"body":["據歐洲時報報道，法國一項旨在加強打擊性暴力的法案將於10月進入議會審議。輿論普遍認為，該法案的加速推進與近期引發全國關注的“莉安娜案”直接相關——這起案件讓公眾對司法系統處理性暴力案件的方式提出強烈質疑。","法案的核心方向包括：降低性暴力案件的舉證與追訴門檻、延長部分罪行的追訴時效，以及強化對受害者的程序保護與援助。支持者認為，法國現行的“同意”認定標準與辦案流程對受害者過於苛刻。","過去幾年，法國圍繞“同意年齡”與性暴力定義的立法討論反覆拉鋸。此次法案若獲通過，將成為該國#MeToo時代以來最重要的性暴力立法進展之一。"],"src":"歐洲時報","url":"https://www.oushinet.com/static/content/france/2026-09-02/1544740884166357230.html","region":"歐洲"},{"id":"001-5","img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","t":"《浙江省婦女權益保障條例》正式落地","d":"條例施行後，浙江多地啟動普法基層行活動，推動婦女權益保障從紙面走向實踐。","en":{"t":"Zhejiang's Regulation on Women's Rights Protection Takes Effect","d":"With the new regulation in force, Zhejiang launches grassroots legal-awareness campaigns to turn women's rights protection from paper into practice.","body":["Zhejiang Province's Regulation on the Protection of Women's Rights and Interests took effect this month, adding local detail to the national law — covering employment, marriage and family, personal safety and property rights, and spelling out the responsibilities of employers, grassroots organisations and government departments.","To support implementation, Zhejiang has launched community-level legal-awareness campaigns — talks, case exhibitions and free legal clinics that translate legal language into everyday terms. A second round is already underway in districts such as Xiaoshan in Hangzhou.","The rollout is seen as part of a chain from national legislation through local regulation to grassroots enforcement — because the life of a law, ultimately, lies in its implementation."]},"body":["《浙江省婦女權益保障條例》本月正式施行，成為繼國家上位法修訂後，地方層面配套落地的又一重要法規。條例細化了婦女在就業、婚姻家庭、人身安全與財產權益等方面的保護條款，並明確了用人單位、基層組織與政府部門的責任分工。","為配合條例落地，浙江多地啟動“普法基層行”活動，通過社區宣講、案例展板與法律諮詢，把條款翻譯成普通家庭聽得懂的語言。活動第二期已在杭州蕭山等區縣展開。","地方條例的密集出臺，被視為中國婦女權益保障“國家立法—地方配套—基層執行”鏈條補全的信號：法律的生命，正在於落地。"],"src":"澎湃新聞","url":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34031959","region":"中國"},{"id":"001-6","img":"assets/img/body-choice.png?v=3","t":"美國：聯邦上訴法院再次審理米非司酮案","d":"針對墮胎藥物米非司酮的訴訟再度進入聯邦上訴法院，ACLU呼籲駁回“毫無根據”的挑戰。","en":{"t":"US: Federal Appeals Court Hears Mifepristone Challenge — Again","d":"The long-running lawsuit against the abortion pill mifepristone returns to a federal appeals court, with the ACLU urging judges to reject a \"baseless\" challenge.","body":["The legal battle over mifepristone has returned to a federal appeals court. Since the Supreme Court dismissed standing in 2024, anti-abortion groups have mounted a fresh challenge targeting the FDA's decades-old approval and regulation of the drug.","The ACLU calls the case \"baseless\", citing decades of research on the drug's safety, and warns that restricting mifepristone would deal a heavy blow to medication abortion nationwide — especially in states where clinic access has already collapsed.","Medication abortion now accounts for more than 60% of abortions in the United States. The case is being watched as a key test of reproductive rights in the post-Roe era."]},"body":["圍繞墮胎藥物米非司酮的訴訟再次來到聯邦上訴法院。這是自美國最高法院2024年駁回原告資格以來，反對墮胎團體對米非司酮發起的又一輪法律挑戰，目標直指FDA對該藥物二十餘年的批准與使用規則。","美國公民自由聯盟（ACLU）在聲明中稱這場挑戰“毫無根據”，指出米非司酮的安全性已被數十項研究證實，並警告：若限制令成立，全美藥物流產的可及性將受到嚴重衝擊，尤其是在墮胎服務已大幅收縮的州。","藥物流產如今佔美國人工終止妊娠總數的六成以上。此案的走向，被視為羅訴韋德案被推翻後，美國生育權利博弈的又一個關鍵觀察點。"],"src":"ACLU","url":"https://www.aclu.org/press-releases/federal-appeals-court-hears-baseless-challenge-to-the-abortion-pill-mifepristone-again","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"健康與權益","en_cat":"Health & Rights","items":[{"id":"001-7","img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","t":"美國：宮外孕死亡人數近翻倍，得州尤甚","d":"研究顯示美國宮外孕死亡人數幾乎翻倍，限制墮胎的州情況更為嚴峻，引發對孕產婦健康的廣泛擔憂。","en":{"t":"US: Ectopic Pregnancy Deaths Have Nearly Doubled — and It's Worse in Texas","d":"New research shows ectopic-pregnancy deaths in the US have nearly doubled, with the sharpest toll in abortion-restrictive states like Texas.","body":["New research cited by the National Partnership for Women & Families shows that ectopic-pregnancy deaths in the United States have nearly doubled in recent years — with the worst outcomes in states with the strictest abortion bans, such as Texas. An ectopic pregnancy is never viable and can be fatal without prompt treatment.","Researchers point to delays in care: in states with bans, doctors fearing legal liability may postpone treatment of emergencies like ectopic pregnancy until a patient's life is visibly at risk — turning preventable tragedies into reality.","The report calls on states to enact clear emergency exceptions and liability shields so clinicians can save lives without fear of prosecution. Maternal health has become the heaviest footnote in America's abortion debate."]},"body":["美國國家婦女與家庭夥伴關係組織援引的最新研究顯示，美國宮外孕死亡人數在近年幾乎翻倍，而在墮胎限制最嚴格的得克薩斯州，情況更為嚴峻。宮外孕無法繼續妊娠且若不及時處理可危及生命，醫療處置的延誤是關鍵風險因素。","研究者指出，在墮胎禁令生效的州，醫生出於對法律風險的顧慮，可能推遲對宮外孕等急症的處理，直到患者出現生命危險。這種“延誤醫療”正在把本可避免的悲劇變成現實。","報告呼籲各州立法明確急診例外條款，並建立醫療機構的免責機制，讓醫生能夠“依法救人而不必懼怕訴訟”。孕產婦健康正在成為美國生育權利爭論中最沉重的註腳。"],"src":"National Partnership for Women & Families","url":"https://nationalpartnership.org/news-ectopic-pregnancy-deaths-have-nearly-doubled-and-its-worse-in-texas/","region":"北美"}]},{"cat":"職場平等","en_cat":"Workplace Equality","items":[{"id":"001-8","img":"assets/img/workplace.png?v=3","t":"日本：性別平等排名全球第117位，繼續G7墊底","d":"最新排名顯示日本男女平等指數僅列全球第117位，在七國集團中持續墊底，職場與政界的性別差距仍是焦點。","en":{"t":"Japan Ranks 117th in Global Gender Equality — Still Last in the G7","d":"The latest index places Japan 117th worldwide for gender equality, again the worst among G7 nations, with workplace and political gaps in the spotlight.","body":["According to Japan's Overseas Chinese News, Japan ranks 117th in the latest Global Gender Gap Index — once again last among the G7. The World Economic Forum index shows Japan scoring persistently low on political empowerment and women in management.","Women's share of parliamentary seats and of corporate boards remains far below major Western economies. Although the government targets 30% of leadership roles for women by 2030, critics say the goal lacks enforcement and adequate childcare support.","Ageing and labour shortages should have made women's participation an economic necessity — but the high share of women in non-regular work and stubborn pay gaps keep the promise of \"womenomics\" unfulfilled."]},"body":["據日本華僑報報道，在最新一期全球性別差距指數中，日本位列第117位，繼續在七國集團中墊底。這份由世界經濟論壇編制的指數顯示，日本在政治賦權與企業管理層女性比例上的得分長期徘徊在低位。","日本國會中女性議員的佔比、上市公司女性董事的比例，均遠低於歐美主要經濟體。儘管政府提出“到2030年將女性管理層比例提升至30%”的目標，但批評者指出，缺乏強制力與配套育兒支持的目標更像口號。","人口老齡化與勞動力短缺本應成為推動女性就業的契機，但非正規僱傭中女性佔比偏高、同工不同酬等問題，讓“女性經濟學”始終未能兌現其承諾。"],"src":"日本華僑報","url":"http://www.jnocnews.co.jp/n161407.html","region":"東亞"},{"id":"001-9","img":"assets/img/workplace.png?v=3","t":"澳大利亞：男女平等排名創歷史新高","d":"最新數據顯示澳大利亞男女平等程度達到有記錄以來的最高水平。","en":{"t":"Australia: Gender Equality Ranking Hits Record High","d":"New data shows Australian men and women are more equal than ever on record.","body":["New data shows gender equality in Australia has reached its highest level on record, driven by steady gains in women's employment, leadership representation and educational attainment.","Analysts credit a mix of policies: mandatory publication of gender pay gaps, childcare subsidy reform, and the spread of corporate diversity targets. Yet occupational segregation in sectors such as mining and construction remains visible.","At a time when progress is stalling in many developed economies, Australia's upward curve is being studied as evidence that a well-designed policy mix can work."]},"body":["澳大利亞最新數據顯示，該國男女平等程度達到有記錄以來的最高水平。這一進展體現在女性就業率、管理層比例與教育獲得的持續改善上。","分析人士指出，強制性的性別薪酬差距公示制度、育兒補貼改革與企業多元目標的普及，是推動排名的關鍵政策組合。不過，礦業與建築等傳統行業的性別隔離依然明顯。","在多數發達國家性別平等進展趨緩的背景下，澳大利亞的上升曲線被研究者視為“政策組合拳”可以奏效的例證。"],"src":"AAP","url":"https://www.dailymail.com/wires/aap/article-16135631/Aussie-men-women-ranking-equal-ever.html","region":"大洋洲"}]},{"cat":"生育權利","en_cat":"Reproductive Rights","items":[{"id":"001-10","img":"assets/img/women-power.png?v=3","t":"墨西哥的墮胎權勝利：拉美經驗或為美國提供借鑑","d":"拉美女性權利組織指出，墨西哥在墮胎去罪化上的勝利，或為正在激烈博弈的美國提供經驗與路徑。","en":{"t":"Mexico's Abortion Victory: Latin America's Lessons for the US","d":"Latin American women's rights groups say Mexico's decriminalisation win may hold the key to the US struggle.","body":["Latin American women's rights groups argue that Mexico's abortion decriminalisation could offer lessons for the United States. After Mexico's Supreme Court ruled criminalisation unconstitutional, state after state followed — part of the movement known as the \"Green Wave\".","The Green Wave's playbook: reframe abortion from a moral dispute to a question of public health and freedom, advance through both courts and streets, and build cross-class solidarity around simple symbols such as the green scarf. With Argentina and Colombia following suit, Latin America has become one of the world's most dynamic fronts for reproductive rights.","Activists caution that transplanting the playbook to America's federal system and polarised politics is hard — and that the region's own lesson applies equally: decriminalisation is not the same as access, and getting services to women in remote areas is the second half of the fight."]},"body":["拉美女性權利組織近期表示，墨西哥在墮胎去罪化上取得的勝利，或能為正在激烈博弈的美國提供經驗與路徑。過去數年，墨西哥最高法院裁定墮胎入刑違憲，各州相繼跟進，形成被稱為“綠色浪潮”的運動。","“綠色浪潮”的核心經驗在於：把墮胎權從道德爭議重構為公共衛生與自由議題，通過司法途徑與街頭運動雙線推進，並以圍巾等符號建立跨階層認同。阿根廷、哥倫比亞的相繼去罪化，讓拉美成為全球生育權利運動最活躍的地區之一。","活動人士坦言，美國的聯邦體制與兩黨極化使經驗移植並不簡單，但“去罪化不等於醫療可及”的教訓同樣深刻：法律勝利之後，如何讓偏遠地區的女性真正獲得服務，是拉美與美國共同的下半場。"],"src":"KRGV","url":"https://www.krgv.com/news/latin-america-women-s-rights-groups-say-their-abortion-win-in-mexico-may-hold-the-key-to-us-struggle","region":"拉美"}]},{"cat":"社會","en_cat":"Society","items":[{"id":"001-11","img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","t":"穆斯林世界聯盟：針對女性的暴力沒有伊斯蘭合法性","d":"穆斯林世界聯盟負責人公開表示，暴力侵害女性沒有任何伊斯蘭教法依據，呼籲穆斯林社會共同反對基於性別的暴力。","en":{"t":"Muslim World League: Violence Against Women Has No Islamic Legitimacy","d":"The head of the Muslim World League publicly states that violence against women has no basis in Islamic law, urging Muslim societies to reject gender-based violence.","body":["The Secretary-General of the Muslim World League has issued a public statement declaring that \"violence against women has no Islamic legitimacy\" — a line widely read as a formal boundary drawn by one of the Islamic world's most authoritative bodies.","The statement stresses that violence against women violates the foundational principles of Islamic law and contradicts a long tradition of honouring women's dignity and rights. It urges Muslim scholars, religious institutions and civil society to stand together against domestic violence and all forms of gender-based violence.","Globally, religious leaders hold unique power to shift community norms. Women's rights groups welcomed the statement — while noting that its real test is whether it translates into action in local communities and courtrooms."]},"body":["穆斯林世界聯盟負責人公開發表聲明，明確表示“針對女性的暴力沒有任何伊斯蘭合法性”。這一表態被外界解讀為伊斯蘭世界權威機構對基於性別暴力的正式劃界。","聲明指出，對婦女的暴力行為既違背伊斯蘭教法的基本原則，也背離伊斯蘭文明對女性尊嚴與權利的長期傳統。聯盟呼籲各國穆斯林學者、宗教機構與社會組織共同反對家庭暴力與一切形式的性別暴力。","在全球範圍內，宗教領袖的立場對改變社群觀念具有獨特影響力。婦女權利組織對此表示歡迎，同時強調：聲明的真正檢驗，在於它能否轉化為各地社區層面的行動與司法實踐。"],"src":"Africa Intelligence","url":"https://www.afintl.com/en/202609111386","region":"中東"}]},{"cat":"文化","en_cat":"Culture","items":[{"id":"001-12","img":"assets/img/womens-rights.png?v=3","t":"第83屆威尼斯電影節：梅爾·圖琪憑《女人，未知》摘金獅","d":"丹麥導演梅爾·圖琪成為史上第八位獲金獅獎的女性電影人，主演瑪蒂爾德·阿塞爾·F.獲最佳女演員獎。授獎辭中她呼籲：照亮共同歷史中那些不為人知的女性。","en":{"t":"Venice 83: May el-Toukhy Wins the Golden Lion for 'The Woman, Unknown'","d":"Danish director May el-Toukhy becomes only the eighth woman to win the Golden Lion; star Mathilde Assef F. takes Best Actress.","body":["On the evening of 12 September, the 83rd Venice Film Festival came to a close on the Lido. The main jury, led by American filmmaker Maggie Gyllenhaal, awarded the Golden Lion to Danish director May el-Toukhy's \"The Woman, Unknown\", with Lee Chang-dong's \"Possible Love\" taking the Grand Jury Prize.","\"The Woman, Unknown\" is the third feature from the Danish-born, Egyptian-descended director. Set around World War II, it follows Marie, a young housekeeper carrying a secret, who is about to marry her wealthy employer — until Denmark's post-war reckoning with \"collaborators\" brings her secret to the surface. Star Mathilde Assef F. also won Best Actress.","Among the 21 films in main competition, \"The Woman, Unknown\" was the only one solely directed by a woman. El-Toukhy becomes only the eighth female filmmaker to win the Golden Lion, after Margarethe von Trotta, Agnès Varda, Sofia Coppola, Chloé Zhao and others. In her speech she was blunt about the industry's unequal treatment of women directors, saying she was driven by \"an urgent need — to illuminate the unknown women of our shared history\"."]},"body":["當地時間9月12日晚，第83屆威尼斯電影節落下帷幕。由美國電影人瑪吉·吉倫哈爾領銜的主競賽評審團，將最高榮譽金獅獎授予丹麥導演梅爾·圖琪（May el-Toukhy）的《女人，未知》（The Woman, Unknown），韓國導演李滄東憑《可能的愛情》獲評審團大獎。","《女人，未知》是這位丹麥出生的埃及裔導演的第三部劇情長片，故事設定在“二戰”前後的丹麥：懷有秘密的年輕女管家瑪麗準備嫁給富有僱主，而戰後對“通敵者”的清算讓她的秘密逐漸浮出水面。影片主演瑪蒂爾德·阿塞爾·F.同時摘得最佳女演員獎。","本屆主競賽21部入圍影片中，《女人，未知》是唯一完全出自女性導演之手的作品。梅爾·圖琪由此成為繼瑪格麗特·馮·特羅塔、阿涅斯·瓦爾達、索菲亞·科波拉、趙婷等人之後，第八位獲金獅獎的女性電影人。授獎辭中她直言行業對女性電影人機會的不公，並說自己堅持的動力是“一種迫切的需要——去照亮我們共同歷史中那些不為人知的女性”。"],"src":"澎湃新聞","url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/detail/34060150","region":"歐洲"},{"id":"001-13","t":"木心美術館年度特展“回望張愛玲”","d":"以手稿、影像與裝置，回望這位影響幾代讀者的女作家。","en":{"t":"Muxin Art Museum's Annual Exhibition Looks Back at Eileen Chang","d":"Manuscripts, films and installations revisit the woman writer who shaped generations of readers.","body":["The Muxin Art Museum's 2026 annual exhibition, \"Looking Back at Eileen Chang\", has opened. Through manuscripts, photographs, film clips and installations, it revisits the writer who shaped generations of readers — from the literary world of \"Love in a Fallen City\" and \"The Golden Cangue\" to her dual bonds with Shanghai and Hong Kong.","The curators aim to show a three-dimensional Chang: not only the cool, bleak novelist, but a sharp essayist, translator and screenwriter. The exhibition highlights her 1940s film scripts, restoring a dimension long overshadowed by her identity as a novelist.","In an era when women's writing is being rediscovered and revalued, the exhibition is both a tribute to one writer and a reaffirmation of a female tradition in Chinese-language literature."]},"body":["木心美術館2026年度特展“回望張愛玲”近日開展。展覽以手稿、照片、影像與裝置等多種媒介，回望這位影響了幾代讀者的女作家——從《傾城之戀》《金鎖記》的文學世界，到其與上海、香港兩座城市的雙重羈絆。","策展方試圖呈現一個“立體”的張愛玲：不只是冷峻蒼涼的小說家，也是敏銳的散文家、譯者與電影編劇。展覽特別梳理了她1940年代的電影劇本創作，還原一個長期被“小說家”身份遮蔽的張愛玲。","在一個女性書寫被重新發現與重估的時代，“回望張愛玲”既是對一位作家的紀念，也是一次對華語文學女性傳統的重新確認。"],"src":"展訊","url":"https://www.sohu.com/a/1074271399_100152450","region":"中國"}]},{"cat":"科技與公益","en_cat":"Tech & Philanthropy","items":[{"id":"001-14","t":"中國婦基會啟動“木蘭AI健康計劃”","d":"中國婦女發展基金會發起“木蘭AI健康計劃”，並參與發佈“我們WOMEN·AI”倡議，推動AI技術惠及女性健康。","en":{"t":"China Women's Development Foundation Launches 'Mulan AI Health Programme'","d":"The foundation launches an AI-driven women's health programme and joins the 'We WOMEN·AI' initiative.","body":["The China Women's Development Foundation has announced the \"Mulan AI Health Programme\" and joined the launch of the \"We WOMEN·AI\" initiative. The programme aims to use artificial intelligence to make health services more accessible for women, especially in grassroots and remote areas — from screening and health literacy to navigation of care.","The initiative also pushes in a second direction: bringing more women into the AI industry itself. Organisers argue that technology built without women's participation can hardly be expected to answer women's needs.","As AI adoption accelerates in 2026, pairing \"tech for good\" with \"tech for women\" is emerging as a new direction in Chinese philanthropy."]},"body":["中國婦女發展基金會宣佈啟動“木蘭AI健康計劃”，並參與發佈“我們WOMEN·AI”倡議。計劃旨在利用人工智能技術，提升女性尤其是基層與偏遠地區女性的健康服務可及性：從健康篩查、疾病科普到就醫導引，AI被設計為“最後一公里”的助手。","倡議同時關注兩個面向：一是讓AI成為女性健康的工具，二是讓更多女性進入AI行業、參與技術的定義。主辦方認為，缺乏女性參與的技術，天然難以回應女性需求。","在AI應用加速落地的2026年，“技術向善”與“技術向女”的結合，正在成為中國公益領域的新方向之一。"],"src":"澎湃新聞","url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34084972","region":"中國"}]},{"cat":"體育","en_cat":"Sports","items":[{"id":"001-15","t":"女子板球亞洲盃上演印巴對決","d":"2026女子板球亞洲盃印度對陣巴基斯坦的焦點戰引發廣泛關注，女選手表現持續點亮賽場。","en":{"t":"Women's Asia Cup: India–Pakistan Clash Lights Up the Tournament","d":"The India–Pakistan showdown at the 2026 Women's Asia Cup drew wide attention as women cricketers continue to shine.","body":["The 2026 Women's Asia Cup staged its most-watched fixture: India versus Pakistan. Beyond the rivalry, the match extended the rapid rise of women's cricket across the region.","The star power of players such as Indian captain Harmanpreet Kaur has pushed ticket sales and broadcast numbers to new highs, while the professionalisation of women's teams across Asia is taking the game to wider audiences.","From stands to screens, the commercial value of women's sport is being repriced — and behind it all, countless girls now have the option of becoming professional athletes."]},"body":["2026女子板球亞洲盃迎來最受關注的一場較量：印度對陣巴基斯坦。這場焦點戰不僅是兩隊實力的直接對話，更延續了女子板球近年快速升溫的熱度。","印度隊隊長哈曼普麗特·考爾等明星球員的號召力，讓女子板球的票房與轉播數據連創新高。亞洲多國女隊的職業化進程，正在把這項運動帶向更廣闊的觀眾。","從看臺到屏幕，女子體育的商業價值正在被重新定價——而這背後，是無數女孩第一次擁有了“成為職業運動員”的選項。"],"src":"Sandesh","url":"https://sandesh.com/cricket/news/india-vs-pakistan-womens-asia-cup-harmanpreet-kaur","region":"南亞"}]}]}];